iyar Zinn Digital®','Hire a WordPress expert on ZinnHub'=>'Yi hayar ƙwararren WordPress a ZinnHub','A freelance marketplace for WordPress design, development, translation and SEO work.'=>'Kasuwancin \'yan kwangila don zane-zane, ci gaba, fassara, da kuma aikin SEO na WordPress.','Visit ZinnHub'=>'Ziyarci ZinnHub','Bulk site and PBN hosting'=>'Gungumen rukunin shafuka da PBN hosting','PBN.ltd is our platform for hosting and managing many sites at once.'=>'PBN.ltd shine dandamalinmu na ɗaukar nauyi da sarrafa shafuka da yawa a lokaci guda.','Visit PBN.ltd'=>'Ziyarci PBN.ltd','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro and Tranzly Pro together'=>'Sami Page Builder Sandwich Pro da Tranzly Pro tare','The bundle costs less than buying both plugins separately, on the same plans and site limits.'=>'Kudin kunshin ya fi rahusa idan aka kwatanta da siyan plugins ɗin biyu daban-daban, a kan tsare-tsare da iyakokin shafuka iri ɗaya.','See the bundle'=>'Duba fakitin','Get %s'=>'Samu %s','Integration active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Haɗin kai yana aiki: %1$s da %2$s suna a tare','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of AI provider keys and one settings screen for them.'=>'%s yana aiki a wannan rukunin yanar gizon, saboda haka duka biyu na amfani da maɓallan mai ba da sabis na AI guda ɗaya da kuma allo na saituna ɗaya a gare su.','Translate this site with Tranzly'=>'Fassara wannan shafin da Tranzly','Build pages visually with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Gina shafuka ta hanyar gani tare da Page Builder Sandwich','%s, from Zinn Digital®'=>'%s, daga Zinn Digital®','Publish every page in many languages, with translated addresses, SEO data and a language switcher. Works with the pages you build here.'=>'Bugaza kowane shafi a cikin harsuna da yawa, tare da adireshi da aka fassara, bayanan SEO da kuma mai sauya harshe. Yana aiki tare da shafukan da kake ginawa a nan.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Zana shafuka kai tsaye a cikin edita tare da manyan gine-gine masu sauri da marasa alamar bincike. Komai da kuka gina yana fassara tare da Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s kungiyar ta yi kuma tana aiki tare da wannan plugin din.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Yi yarda da haɗa wannan shafin da farko.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Shigar da ingantacciyar adireshin imel.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Yi amincewa da aiko da bayanan tallafi tukuna.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Rubuta jigo da sako.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Shigar da adireshin imel da sashen goyon baya zai iya ba da amsa.','Temporary support access created by the site owner. It is deleted automatically when it expires.'=>'Mai shi ya ƙirƙiro damar shiga tallafi na ɗan lokaci. Ana goge shi ta atomatik idan lokacinsa ya ƙare.','Choose 1, 3 or 7 days.'=>'Zaɓi kwanaki 1, 3 ko 7.','Only a site administrator, signed in to this screen, can create temporary support access.'=>'Wani mai kula da shafin kawai, wanda ya shiga wannan allo, ne zai iya ƙirƙirar damar shiga ta goyon baya na ɗan lokaci.','A unique user name could not be chosen. Try again.'=>'Ba a iya zaɓar keɓaɓɓen sunan mai amfani ba. Sake gwadawa.','Zinn Digital® support (temporary)'=>'Tallafin Zinn Digital® (na wucin gadi)','This temporary support access has expired.'=>'Wannan damar tallafi na ɗan lokaci ta ƙare.','AI providers'=>'Masu ba da sabis na AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Masu aikata ChatGPT. Kwararren mai yin komai sosai.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Masu ƙirƙirar Claude. Suna da ƙarfi wajen rubutawa kuma suna da hankali wajen yin la\'akari.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Samfurin Gemini na Google. Masu sauri da rahusa.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Wani kamfanin AI na Turai mai sauri da arha samfura.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Samfuran mai sauƙi waɗanda ke da kyau wajen rubutu da lissafi.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Maɓalli guda ɗaya don samfuran daga masu samarwa daban-daban.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Duk wani sabis da ke aiki kamar API na OpenAI, gami da samfurin da ke aiki akan kwamfutarka ko uwar garken ka.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gabaɗaya (ana amfani da shi lokacin da babu takamaiman abin da aka saita)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Rubuta da sake rubutawa','Translation'=>'Fassara','Code and CSS'=>'Lamba da CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin shiga wannan shafin ba.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Wadannan saitunan suna da alaƙa da kowane plugin da ke amfani da su: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'An ɓoye Maɓallanka a cikin bayanan wannan shafin kuma ana aika su ne kawai zuwa ga mai ba da sabis da kuka zaɓa - ba za a taba aika su gare mu ba.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Mataki na 1 na 2: zabi mai ba da sabis na AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Kuna kawo naku key, don haka kuna biyan mai ba da sabis ɗin kai tsaye don abin da kuka yi amfani da shi. Ba ku da tabbas? Ko wanne daga cikin waɗannan yana aiki sosai; za ku iya ƙara ƙarin daga baya.','Next'=>'Na gaba','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Mataki na 2 na 2: haɗa %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗin da ke da jituwa da OpenAI, wanda ya ƙare da /v1. Ana buƙatar maɓalli ne kawai idan sabis ɗin ya nemi ɗaya.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Buɗe %s sannan ka shiga (ko ka ƙirƙiri sabon ajiya kyauta).','the %s API keys page'=>'shafin mabulsan API na %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ƙirƙiri sabuwar maɓalli sannan ka kwafi ita.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Li manna shi a kasa sannan a danna "Ajiye a gwada". Muna tura karamin buƙatu guda ɗaya don bincika yana aiki.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Yawancin masu ba da sabis suna buƙatar ɗan kuɗi a cikin asusun kafin maɓalli ya yi aiki: %s.','add credit'=>'ƙara bashi','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Zabi wani mai ba da sabis daban','Address'=>'Adireshin','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Aɓuƙan da aka ajiye yana ƙarewa a …%s — liƙa sabo don maye gurbin sa','Key (optional)'=>'Maɓalli (zaɓi)','API key'=>'Maɓallin API','Save and test'=>'Ajiye kuma a gwada','Providers'=>'Masu bada sabis','Provider'=>'Mai ba da sabis','Status'=>'Matsayi','Key'=>'Maɓalli','Get a key'=>'Samu maɓalli','Test'=>'Gwaji','Remove'=>'Cire','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Wanda wani sabon sigar plugin ya adana: sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma a sake shigar da mabudin.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin da aka ajiye ba kuma (an canza maɓallin tsaro na shafin). Shigar da shi sake.','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'An haɗa — gwajin ƙarshe ya yi nasara %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Gwajin da ya gabata ya gaza: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'An haɗa — ba a gwada ba tukuna','Which model to use'=>'Wane model za a yi amfani da shi','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ yana nuna shawararmu don wannan aikin. Jerin ya ƙunshi kowane samfurin da maɓallinku zai iya amfani da shi, wanda aka karanta kai tsaye daga mai bada sabis ɗin.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— An ba da shawarar ga mai bada sabis —','Save models'=>'Ajiye samfura','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sabunta jerin samfuran daga masu samarwa','Images'=>'Hotuna','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Haɗa OpenAI ko Google Gemini don yin hotuna.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin hoto na farko na mai ba da sabis da aka haɗa —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Binciken shafin ( embeddings)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter don gina fihirisar bincike na shafin ku.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Sabon samfurin sakawa na farko wanda aka haɗa —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Canza wannan yana sake gina fihirisar bincike ta kowane plugin da ke amfani da ita.','best quality'=>'mafi kyau','lowest cost'=>'mafi ƙarancin farashi','fastest'=>'mafi sauri','Add a model yourself'=>'Ƙara samfuri da kanka','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'An fitar da sabon samfuri a yau? Manna daidai sunansa don amfani da shi nan take.','Model name'=>'Sunan samfurin','Add model'=>'Ƙara samfurin','Recommended models list'=>'Jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Ba a iya tabbatar da jerin samfuran da aka ba da shawarar ba, don haka ba a nuna shawarwari ba. Sake shigar da plugin ɗin, ko kuma kunna sabuntawa na yau da kullum a ƙasa.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Jerin da ake amfani da shi an wallafa shi ne a ranar %s. Kowane sabuntawar kari (plugin) yana kawo sabon guda ɗaya.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Hakanan a bincika Zinn Digital® sau ɗaya a rana don samun sabon jerin sunaye.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ana aika da sauƙaƙe buƙatar saukarwa kawai: babu makulli, babu adireshin shafin, babu wani abu game da abun ciki naka. An sanya hannu kan jerin, kuma an yi watsi da jerin da ya kasa binciken sa hannu.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'An bincika karshe a %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Ajiye, sannan a duba yanzu idan an kunna','a newer list was installed'=>'an shigar da sabon jerin sunaye','already up to date'=>'rigakafi da sabuntawa','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'zazzakunan sun gaza wuce gwajin sa hannu kuma an yi watsi da su','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Ba za a iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba; jerin na yanzu zai ci gaba da amfani','turned off'=>'an kashe','Open'=>'Buɗe','Check their status page'=>'Bincika shafin yanayin su','Open your billing page'=>'Buɗe shafin kuɗi naka','Open your API keys page'=>'Buɗe shafin maɓallan API naka','Open the AI settings'=>'Buɗe saitunan AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin yin hakan ba.','Unknown provider.'=>'Ba a san mai ba da sabis ba.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Shigar da adireshin sabis ɗinku, alal misali http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Wannan ba ya yi kama da maɓallin API ba. Sake kwafin sa, ba tare da guraben sarari ba.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Da farko a liƙa maɓallin API ɗinka.','Key removed.'=>'An cire maɓallin.','Models saved.'=>'An adana samfuran.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Shigar dainiyar sunan samfurin, misali yadda takardun bayanin mai ba da sabis suka rubuta shi.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'An ƙara %s. Zaɓi shi a ƙarƙashin "Wane samfuri za a yi amfani da shi".','Model removed.'=>'An cire samfurin.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'An kashe sabuntawa kullum. Ana amfani da jerin da ya zo tare da plugin din.','Checked: %s.'=>'An Duba: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'An sabunta jerin samfuran.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Wani sabon sigar na ɗaya daga cikin plugins ɗinka ya adana maɓallin AI ɗinka. Sabunta wannan plugin ɗin, ko kuma ka sake shigar da maɓallin a cikin saitunan AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe maɓallin AI ɗinka da aka ajiyage ba (maɓallan tsaron rukunin yanar gizon sun canza). Sake shigar da shi a cikin saitunan AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a saita AI ba tukuna. Ƙara maɓalli don mai ba da AI a cikin saitunan AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a zaɓi samfurin ba don wannan aikin. Zaɓi ɗaya a cikin saitunan AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba a goyi bayansa da wannan sigar ta plugin ba.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ba a haɗa wani mai samar da AI da zai iya ƙirƙirar hotuna ba. Ƙara maɓalli na OpenAI ko Google Gemini a cikin saitunan AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba zai iya yin hotuna ba. Zaɓi OpenAI ko Google Gemini don hotuna a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Ba za a iya amfani da mabudin AI naka tare da wani samfurin hoto ba. Duba izinin mabudin tare da mai ba da sabis din, ko zaɓi wani mai ba da sabis din don hotuna.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Babu wani mai samar da AI da aka haɗa da zai iya gina fihirisar bincike. Ƙara maɓallin Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko OpenRouter a cikin saitunan AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Maɓallin AI ɗinka ba zai iya amfani da kowane samfurin sakawa ba. Bincika izinin maɓallin tare da mai bada sabis ɗin, ko zaɓi wani mai bada sabis daban don binciken shafin.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Wannan mai ba da sabis na AI ba zai iya gina fihirisar bincike ba. Haɗa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ko sabis ɗin da ya dace don binciken shafin.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya tuntuɓar sabis ɗin AI naka ba. Bincika cewa yana aiki kuma ana iya isa ga adireshinsa daga sabar gidan yanar gizon ku (sabis da ke kan kwamfutarka ba zai iya isa ba daga shafin da aka karɓa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Wannan shafin bai iya isa ga %s ba. Duba shafin matsayinsu; idan suna aiki, mai masaukin ku na iya toshe haɗin da ke fita, ko kuma adireshin ba daidai bane.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s ya ce asusunka ba shi da kuɗi ko kuma adadin da ya rage. Ƙara kuɗi ko ɗaga iyakar a cikin asusunka tare da su, sannan a sake gwadawa.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s bai karɓi makullin ku ba. Wataƙila an rubuta shi ba daidai ba, an soke shi ko kuma ya ƙare. Ƙirƙiri sabon maɓalli sannan ka manna shi a nan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s ya ki amincewa da wannan buƙatar don maɓallinka. Wataƙila maɓallin ba shi da damar shiga wannan samfurin ko fasalin, ko kuma asusunka yana buƙatar tabbatarwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Samfurin "%1$s" ba ya samuwa daga %2$s don maɓallin ku. Zaɓi wani samfuri a cikin saitunan AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Tsarin ku na %2$s bai haɗa da samfurin "%1$s" ba. Zaɓi wani samfurin a cikin saitunan AI, ko haɓaka tsarin ku tare da su.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s tana iyakance saurin da makullin ku ke iya aika buƙatu. Jira minti ɗaya kuma sake gwadawa, ko ku ɗaga iyakacin ƙimar ku tare da su.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s yana fuskantar matsaloli a halin yanzu (akwai katsewa ko kuma cunkoso a gefensu). Babu wani abu da ba daidai ba tare da saitunanka. Gwada sake nan ba da dadewa ba.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Om karakteristik AI ta gaza saboda dalilin da ba za mu iya gane shi ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ta ci gaba da faruwa, tuntuɓi sashen goyon baya tare da cikakkun bayanan da ke ƙasa.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mai ba da sabis na AI ya ba da amsa a wata sifa da wannan plugin ɗin bai iya karantawa ba. Sake gwadawa; idan hakan ya ci gaba da faruwa, zaɓi wani samfurin ko tuntuɓi goyon baya.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Keɓaɓɓe (Mai jituwa da OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Farko a adana maɓalli don wannan mai ba da sabis.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Maɓallin ku yana aiki, amma mai ba da sabis ɗin bai lissafa wani samfurin rubutu don shi ba. Ƙara wani samfurin da kanka a ƙasa.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'An haɗa. %1$s ya/ta amsa ta amfani da %2$s. Siffofin AI ɗinka suna shirye don amfani.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Ba a ba matsayin mai amfani da ku izinin amfani da AI a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Tambayi mai gudanarwa.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar kasafin kuɗinsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara shi a cikin saitunan AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kai iyakar buƙatunsa na AI na wata-wata. Mai gudanarwa zai iya ƙara ta a cikin saitunan AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Amfani da kuma tsada','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Rubutun shiga, iyakoki da izinin matsayi suna aiki kan AI da ake amfani da ita ta: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kudin sun kusa zama daidai, an lissafa su ne daga farashin da aka buga; samfurin da babu wani sanannen farashi yana da darajar sifili.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Wannan wata: buƙatun %1$s, kimanin %2$s.','When'=>'Lokacin da','Who'=>'Waye','Used for'=>'A yi amfani da shi don','Model'=>'Samfurin','Tokens in / out'=>'Alamar shiga / fita','About'=>'Game da Mu','Result'=>'Sakamako','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Ba a yi roƙon AI ko ɗaya ba tuƙuna.','Done'=>'An gama','Limits and permissions'=>'Iyakoki da izini','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Iyakar kashe kuɗi ta wata-wata (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Bar shi babu komai don babu iyaka. AI zai tsaya na sauran watan da zarar kudin da aka kiyasta sun kai wurin.','Monthly request limit'=>'Iyakokin buƙatu na kowane wata','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Bar shi a ba komai don babu iyaka.','Who may use AI'=>'Wane ne zai iya amfani da AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Cirewa ba tare da zabi ba don barin kowa wanda zai iya amfani da fasalullukan plugin ɗin ya yi amfani da AI. Masu gudanarwa za su iya amfani da shi kowane lokaci.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Ajiye iyakoki da izini','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'An adadin da izini an adana.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Kuskuren tsaro, don Allah sake loda shafin kuma a sake gwadawa.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Saitunan wasiƙar labarai sun ɓace. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai gudanarwa.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Saitunan jaridar labarai ba su da inganci. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai kula da tsarin.','Invalid email address.'=>'Anwani ta imel ba daidai ba ce.','Please tick the box to agree before subscribing.'=>'Da fat za a yi alamar akwatin domin amincewa kafin a yi rajista.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kokarin da yawa. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintoci kaɗan.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Wani abu ya lalace. Da fatan za a tuntuɓi mai gudanarwa.','Map'=>'Taswira','Background video'=>'Bidiyon bango','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: Fayilolin rubutu %2$d da aka adana, takardar salo %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'Ba a adana wannan iyalin ba.','Removed.'=>'An cire.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Wannan ba ingantaccen sunan iyalin rubutu ba ne.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts bai dawo da wannan iyalin ba. Duba sunan sannan a sake gwadawa.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Ba a iya sauke ko adana fayilolin rubutun ba. Tabbatar cewa foldar loda tana da ikon rubutawa.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Ba a iya adana takardar salon haruffa (font stylesheet) ba. Duba ko babban fayil din loda abubuwa (uploads folder) yana da ikon karɓar rubutu.','Dismiss this notice'=>'Kora da wannan sanarwa','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana buɗe a sabon shafin)','Done:'=>'An gama:','To do:'=>'Abin yi:','Glossary index'=>'Manunin ƙamus','Rated %1$s out of %2$s'=>'An kiyasta %1$s cikin %2$s','Progress'=>'Ci gaba','%s%%'=>'%s%%','Copy code'=>'Kwafi lambar','Copied'=>'An kwafi','That widget is not available on this site.'=>'Wancan widget din ba ya samuwa a wannan rukunin yanar gizon.','Email'=>'Imel','Phone'=>'Waya','RSS feed'=>'Tashar RSS','Website'=>'Shafin yanar gizo','Link'=>'Haɗi','%s (opens in a new tab)'=>'%s (yana buɗe a sabon shafin)','Rated %d out of 5'=>'An kima da %d daga cikin 5','(recommended)'=>'(an ba da shawarar)','Included'=>'An haɗa','Not included'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Comparison table'=>'Tabbatar kwatanta','Call %s'=>'Kira %s','Email %s'=>'Imel %s','Text %s'=>'Rubutu %s','Chat on WhatsApp'=>'Yi hira a WhatsApp','Contact us'=>'Tuntuɓe mu','Chat with us on WhatsApp'=>'Yi hira da mu a WhatsApp','This form is not available right now.'=>'Ba a samun wannan fom a yanzu.','This form cannot be shown because %s is not active.'=>'Ba za a iya nuna wannan fom ba domin %s ba ya aiki.','Map: %s'=>'Taswira: %s','Showing the map loads it from OpenStreetMap.'=>'Nuna taswirar na loda ta ne daga OpenStreetMap.','Show the map'=>'Nuna taswirar','Open the map on OpenStreetMap'=>'Bude taswirar a kan OpenStreetMap','Booking calendar from %s'=>'Kalandar ajiyar wuri daga %s','Showing the booking calendar loads it from %s.'=>'Nunna kalandar ajiyar wuri yana lodi daga %s.','Show the booking calendar'=>'Nuna kalandar ajiyar wuri','Book on %s'=>'Yi Littafi a kan %s','QR code for %s'=>'Lambar QR don %s','Design'=>'Tsara Design','Content'=>'Abun ciki','Media'=>'Watsa labarai','Marketing'=>'Tallace-tallace','Site'=>'Shafi\'i','Data'=>'Bayanan','Affiliate & iGaming'=>'Affiliate da iGaming','Related posts'=>'Rubututtuka masu alaƙa','Post details'=>'Bayanan sako','By'=>'Ta hanyar','Published'=>'An buga','Updated'=>'An sabunta','In'=>'Ciki','Tagged'=>'An saka alama','%d minute read'=>'minti %d karatu' . "\0" . 'Mintuna %d na karatu','No comments yet'=>'Babu Sharhi tukuna','%d comment'=>'Sharhi %d' . "\0" . 'ra\'ayoyi %d','Sitemap'=>'Taswirar rukunin yanar gizo','(no title)'=>'(babu lakabi)','All posts by %s'=>'Duk rubutun da %s ya yi','This content is protected. Enter the password to see it.'=>'Wannan abun ciki yana da kariya. Shigar da kalmar sirri don ganin shi.','That password is not right. Try again.'=>'Waccan kalmar sirri ba daidai ba ce. Sake gwadawa.','Password'=>'Kalmar sirri','Show the content'=>'Nuna abinda ke ciki','That page cannot be unlocked.'=>'Ba za a iya buɗe wannan shafin ba.','Too many tries. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Ƙoƙari da yawa. Jira ƴan mintuna kaɗan sannan ka sake gwadawa.','The password must be 4 to 200 characters long.'=>'Dole ne kalmar sirrin ta kasance tsakanin haruffa 4 zuwa 200.','More'=>'Ƙari','Close'=>'Rufe','Tab %d'=>'Shafi %d','Contents'=>'Abubuwan da ke ciki','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Babu rubutun allo na mai gudanarwa a cikin wannan kwafin na plugin ɗin. Sake shigar da shi daga fakitin da aka fitar.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Wannan allon yana buƙatar JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Harsuna','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Kai abokin huldar hosting ne? Samu rangwamen %1$d%% a kan %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'A matsayinka na abokin ciniki mai karɓar baƙi na Zinn Digital®, kana samun lambar sirri don samun rangwamen %d%% a kan biyan kuɗinka na farko. Sabuntawa suna kan farashin al\'ada.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Sami lambar %d%% ta kuma je wurin biya','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Wannan rangwamen na abokan ciniki ne masu tsarin daukar shafukan yanar gizo da suka biya kuma ba su da wata matsala. Gwaje-gwaje kyauta ba sa cancanta.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Kun riga kun yi amfani da rangwamen abokin ciniki na masaukin yanar gizo don wannan plugin.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba mu iya samun lambar ku ba a yanzu. Da fatan za a sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintoci kaɗan.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Dole ne prefix ya zama haruffa ƙanana 1 zuwa 8 ko lambobi, ya kafa da harshe, kuma kada ya sanya wa plugin suna.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin gyara wannan abu ba.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Ba a ba ka izinin yin wannan ba.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'An kashe yanayin tsaro domin baya dace da shigarka ta gaba. Sake loda shafin.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Mai gudanarwa ne kawai zai iya amfani da yanayin aminci.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Yanayin aminci yana buƙatar shiga ta na\'urar bincike ta al\'ada.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Ba a iya saita yanayin aminci ba.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Yanayin tsaro yana buƙatar damar rubutawa zuwa ga babban fayil na wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta wa zuwa cikin kundin adireshi na wp-content/mu-plugins ba a yanayin kariya (Safe mode).','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Wannan shafin babu shi, ko kuma an goge shi.','Sandwich Studio works with the block editor, and the block editor is switched off for this item. A plugin such as Classic Editor does that: allow the block editor for this item in its settings (Settings → Writing), then open Sandwich Studio again.'=>'Sandwich Studio yana aiki tare da editan buloka, kuma an kashe editan buloka don wannan abin. Wani plugin kamar Classic Editor ne ke yin hakan: ba da damar editan buloka don wannan abin a cikin saitunansa (Saituna → Rubutu), sannan a buɗe Sandwich Studio kuma.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Yi hakuri, ba a ba ka izinin gyara wannan abu a cikin Sandwich Studio ba.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Ba a gina Sandwich Studio ba. Sake shigar da plugin ɗin.','Add title'=>'Ƙara take','Type / to choose a block'=>'Rubuta / don zaɓar wani b da ke rufe','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Ana loda Sandwich Studio...','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio na buƙatar JavaScript. Yi amfani da madadin edita na al\'ada maimakon haka.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Gyara “%s” tare da Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Gyara tare da Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Fanko mara komai','Skip to content'=>'Tsallake zuwa abun ciki','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Dole fadin kwamfutar hannu ya zama lambar pixel duka daga 480 zuwa 2560.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Faɗin wayar hannu dole ne ya zama lambar pixel ta duka, aƙalla 240 kuma ta fi faɗin kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka ƙankanta.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kowane ɓangaren hutu na musamman yana buƙatar nasa ID: haruffa ƙanana 2 zuwa 12 ko lambobi, waɗanda suka fara da harafi.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Wani kebantaccen ma\'aunin karyewa yana aiki ne ko dai har zuwa faɗi (daga pixels 200 zuwa 4000) ko kuma daga faɗi (daga pixels 200 zuwa 6000), ba duka biyun ba.','Tablet'=>'Kwanon kwamfuta','Mobile'=>'Wayar hannു','Site design'=>'Tsarin shafin','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Launi, haruffa da salo waɗanda kowane shafi na shafin da jigon ku suke raba.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Ba a iya buɗe salon gama gari na shafin ba.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Waccan font ba ɗaya ba ne daga cikin font ɗin da ke kan rukunin yanar gizon.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Duk launi yana buƙatar suna na musamman da aka yi da ƙananan haruffa, lambobi, da kuma alamar raba kalma.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Launin "%s" ba ingantaccen launin CSS ba ne.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Duk wani font yana buƙatar suna na musamman da aka yi da ƙananan baƙaƙe, lambobi, da kuma alamar raba kalma (hyphen).','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'Jerin font na "%s" na iya ƙunsar sunayen font kawai, alamomin ambato, waƙafi da gurabaru.','Uploaded icons'=>'Hotunan da aka loda','Icon'=>'Alama','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Wannan fayil 