a rashin inganta lasisin ya gaza.','Your license was successfully deactivated, you are back to the %s plan.'=>'An kashe lasisinka cikin nasara, yanzu ka koma shirin %s.','Your %s license was successfully deactivated.'=>'An cire lasisininka na %s cikin nasara.','Your license has expired. You can still continue using the free %s forever.'=>'Lasisin ku ya kare. Kuna iya ci gaba da amfani da kyauta ta %s har abada.','Your license has expired. %1$sUpgrade now%2$s to continue using the %3$s without interruptions.'=>'Lasisin ku ya ƙare. %1$sHaɓaka yanzu%2$s don ci gaba da amfani da %3$s ba tare da katsewa ba.','Your license has expired. You can still continue using all the %s features, but you\'ll need to renew your license to continue getting updates and support.'=>'Lasisin ku ya ƙare. Har yanzu za ku iya ci gaba da amfani da duk abubuwan %s, amma kuna buƙatar sabunta lasisin ku don ci gaba da samun sabuntawa da goyon baya.','License ID'=>'Lambar Lasisi','License issues?'=>'Matsalolin lasisi?','Single Site License'=>'Lasisin Shaf Ɗaya','Unlimited Licenses'=>'Lasisi Mara iyaka','Up to %s Sites'=>'Har zuwa Shafuka %s','Is this your client\'s site? %s if you wish to hide sensitive info like your email, license key, prices, billing address & invoices from the WP Admin.'=>'Shin wannan shafin abokin cinikin ku ne? %s idan kuna son boye bayanai masu mahimmanci kamar imel ɗin ku, maɓallin lasisi, farashi, adireshin lissafi & da takardun shaida daga WP Admin.','Your %1$s license was flagged as white-labeled to hide sensitive information from the WP Admin (e.g. your email, license key, prices, billing address & invoices). If you ever wish to revert it back, you can easily do it through your %2$s. If this was a mistake you can also %3$s.'=>'An shaidar lasisin ka na %1$s a matsayin mai alamar fari don ɓoye mahimman bayanai daga WP Admin (misali imel ɗin ka, maɓallin lasisi, farashi, adireshin lissafi & da lissafin kuɗi). Idan a wani lokaci kuna son mayar da shi baya, zaka iya yin hakan ta hanyar %2$s. Idan wannan kuskure ne zaka iya kuma %3$s.','Lifetime'=>'Rayuwa','Load DB Option'=>'Loda Zaɓin DB','Localhost'=>'Localhost','Log'=>'Rikodin Ayyuka','Logger'=>'Mai shiga da rajista','Long-Term Duplicate'=>'Dogon Lokaci Mai Koma-baya','Message'=>'Saƙo','Method'=>'Hanyar','Migrate Options to Network'=>'Yi kaura zuwa ga Sadarwa','Migrate'=>'Yi ƙaura','Migrate License'=>'Canja Lasisi','Is %2$s the new home of %4$s?'=>'Shin %2$s shine sabon gida na %4$s?','Yes, %%2$s is replacing %%4$s. I would like to migrate my %s from %%4$s to %%2$s.'=>'Eh, %%2$s yana maye gurbin %%4$s. Ina so in yi ƙaura da %s dina daga %%4$s zuwa %%2$s.','%s minimum payout amount.'=>'%s mafi ƙarancin adadin biya.','as monthly periodmo'=>'mo','Mobile apps'=>'Aikace-aikacen hannu','Module'=>'Modulu','%s Installs'=>'Shigarwa %s','%s Licenses'=>'Lasisi %s','The remote plugin package does not contain a folder with the desired slug and renaming did not work.'=>'Kunshin matosiyar nesa baya dauke da babban fayil mai suna da ake bukata kuma sake suna bai yi aiki ba.','Module Path'=>'Hanyar Module','Module Type'=>'Nau\'in Module','as every monthMonthly'=>'Kowane wata','More information about %s'=>'Ƙarin bayani game da %s','Yes - move all my data and assets from %1$s to %2$s'=>'E - matser da duk bayanai na da kayana daga %1$s zuwa %2$s','No - only move this site\'s data to %s'=>'A\'a - matsar da bayanan wannan rukunin yanar gizon zuwa %s kawai','millisecondsms'=>'ms','The products below have been placed into safe mode because we noticed that %2$s is an exact copy of %3$s:%1$s'=>'An sanya samfuran da ke ƙasa a yanayin tsaro saboda mun lura cewa %2$s kwafi ne daidai da %3$s:%1$s','The products below have been placed into safe mode because we noticed that %2$s is an exact copy of these sites:%3$s%1$s'=>'An sanya kayayyakin da ke ƙasa a yanayin aminci saboda mun lura cewa %2$s kwafi ne daidai na waɗannan shafukan:%3$s%1$s','Name'=>'Suna','Please provide your full name.'=>'Don Allah ka samar da