-expiring'=>'Wanda ba ya ƙarewa','This plugin has not been marked as compatible with your version of WordPress.'=>'Ba a yi alamar cewa wannan plugin ɗin yana da jituwa da sigar ku ta WordPress ba.','This plugin has not been tested with your current version of WordPress.'=>'Ba a gwada wannan plugin din ba tare da sigar ku ta WordPress ta yanzu ba.','not verified'=>'ba a tabbatar ba','as turned offOff'=>'A kashe','O.K'=>'Toh','as turned onOn'=>'A kunna','as once a yearOnce'=>'Sau ɗaya','exclamationOops'=>'To shi kenan','Opt In'=>'Yi Rajista','Allow & Continue'=>'Bada dama & Ci gaba','Opt Out'=>'Fice Daga Ciki','Sharing diagnostic data with %s helps to provide functionality that\'s more relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break your website, and recognize which languages & regions the plugin should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Raba bayanan bincike tare da %s yana taimakawa wajen samar da ayyuka masu amfani ga gidan yanar gizon ku, gujewa rashin dacewar WordPress ko sigar PHP wacce zata iya lalata gidan yanar gizon ku, da kuma gane harsuna & yankunan da ya kamata a fassara plugin din da kuma dacewa da su.','Sharing your name and email allows us to keep you in the loop about new features and important updates, warn you about security issues before they become public knowledge, and send you special offers.'=>'Raba suna da imel ɗinka yana ba mu damar sanar da kai game da sabbin abubuwa da muhimman sabuntawa, gargade ka game da matsalolin tsaro kafin su zama sanannun jama\'a, da kuma tura maka tayin musamman.','Diagnostic data will no longer be sent from %1$s to %2$s.'=>'Ba za a sake aika bayanan bincike daga %1$s zuwa %2$s ba.','Opt in to make "%s" better!'=>'Shiga domin sanya "%s" ya fi kyau!','Opting in'=>'Shiga ciki','Opting out'=>'Fita daga ciki','For ongoing compatibility with your website, you can optionally allow %s to:'=>'Don dacewa mai dorewa tare da gidan yanar gizon ku, za ku iya ba da izini na zaɓi ga %s 