ont has no files yet. Upload at least one.'=>'Waccan font ba ta da fayiloli tukuna. A loda aƙalla ɗaya.','An Adobe Fonts kit id is 5 to 12 letters and digits, as shown in your Adobe Fonts web project.'=>'An Adobe Fonts kit id yana da haruffa 5 zuwa 12 da lamba, kamar yadda aka nuna a cikin aikin gidan yanar gizonku na Adobe Fonts.','Adobe Fonts did not return that kit. Check the id, and that the web project is published.'=>'Adobe Fonts ba ta dawo da wannan kit din ba. Bincika id, kuma tabbatar cewa an buga aikin gidan yanar gizon.','That Adobe Fonts kit has no fonts in it.'=>'Wancan kit na Adobe Fonts ba shi da wani font a ciki.','Choose how the site picks its colour scheme.'=>'Zaɓi yadda shafin ke zaɓar tsarin launinsa.','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Matsayin duhu na "%s" ba ingantaccen launi na CSS ba ne.','This site has reached the maximum number of global classes.'=>'Wannan shafin ya isa matsakaicin adadin azuzuwan duniya.','Give the class a name.'=>'Ba wa aji suna.','%s (copy)'=>'%s (kwafi)','A class name must start with a letter and use only lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Dole sunan azuzu ya fara da haruffa kuma ya yi amfani da kananan haruffa kawai, lambobi da alamomin cirewa.','Another class already uses that name.'=>'Wani aji yana amfani da wannan sunan tuni.','That class no longer exists. Reload the list.'=>'Wannan ajin babu shi kuma. Sake loda jerin.','Extra small'=>'Madaidaici sosai','Small'=>'Karami','Medium'=>'Matsakaici','Large'=>'Babba','Extra large'=>'Babba sosai','Huge'=>'Mai girma','None'=>'Babu kowa','Round'=>'Zagaye','Each entry needs a unique short name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kowane shigarwa yana buƙatar ɗan gajeren suna na musamman da aka yi da ƙananan haruffa, lambobi, da alamar raga.','The value of "%s" is not a value this setting accepts.'=>'Darajar "%s" ba ta kasance darajar da wannan saitin ke karɓa ba.','There are no live reviews here.'=>'Babu ra\'ayoyin jama\'a masu rai a na