nd-replace job no longer exists.'=>'Waccen da bincike da maye gurbin bata nan ba.','That step is not available for this job right now.'=>'Wannan matakin ba ya samuwa ga wannan aikin a yanzu.','Enter what to find.'=>'Shigar da abin da za a nema.','Colours must be hex codes such as #1a73e8 or #fff.'=>'Launi dole su zama lambobi na hex kamar #1a73e8 ko #fff.','The new link must be a full web address (https://…), a path starting with /, or an anchor starting with #.'=>'Sabon hanyar haɗin dole ne ya zama cikakken adireshin gidan yanar gizo (https://…), hanya ce da ta fara da /, ko kuma anga da ta fara da #.','Client review comments'=>'Sharhin bita na abokin ciniki','Write a comment first.'=>'Rubuta sharhi da farko.','Client'=>'Abokin ciniki','That comment no longer exists.'=>'Wannan sharhin babu shi kuma.','New review comment on “%s”'=>'Sabon sharhi kan “%s”','%1$s wrote:

