 count toward your site limit.'=>'Kwafin shafin na gwaji da na kan kwamfuta (localhost) kyauta ne kuma ba sa ƙidaya a cikin iyakan shafukanka ko da yaushe.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Tsarin ku ya ƙunshi goyon baya na fifiko.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Gudanar da lasisin ku da biyan kuɗi','Get more with Pro'=>'Samun ƙari tare da Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Fara gwaji kyauta na kwanaki %d, ba a buƙatar katin biyan kuɗi' . "\0" . 'Fara gwaji kyauta na kwanaki %d, ba a buƙatar katin biyan kuɗi','See plans and prices'=>'Dubi tsare-tsare da farashin su','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Ka yi amfani da Tranzly da Page Builder Sandwich tare? Kunshin ya ƙunshi dukansu biyu na Pro plugins don ƙarami.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Lasisin ku ya ƙare. Sabunta shi don ci gaba da samun sabuntawa da fasalulluka na Pro.','Renew now'=>'Sabunta yanzu','Compare the plans'=>'Kwatanta tsarukan','Search features'=>'Binciko fasali','Area'=>'Yanki','Included in'=>'An haɗa a cikin','No feature matches.'=>'Babu fasalin da ya dace.','Features by plan'=>'Siffofin ta hanyar tsari','Hide'=>'Boye','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Kunna shi a kan allon Plugins','Install it'=>'Shigar da shi','Overview'=>'Takaitaccen Bayani','Setup'=>'Saita','Plans and licence'=>'Shirye-shirye da lasisi','Add-ons'=>'Ƙarin kayan aiki','Feedback'=>'Ra\'ayi','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana zaɓinku ba.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana yanayin saitin ba.','Match my computer'=>'Daidaita da kwamfutata','Light'=>'Haske','Dark'=>'Duhu','Colour scheme'=>'Tsarin launi','Help'=>'Taimako','Guide to this screen'=>'Jagora zuwa wannan allo','Take the tour'=>'Yi yawon shakatawa','Get help or report a bug'=>'Nemi taimako ko ka ba da rahoton matsala','Plugin screens'=>'Fuskar plugin','That could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana shi ba.','Before you contact support'=>'Kafin ka tuntuɓi tallafi','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'An tura buƙatarka daga wannan rukunin yanar gizon zuwa %s, waɗanda suka yi wannan plugin ɗin. Muna aika da:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'adireshin imel dinka da sunanka, domin mu iya ba da amsa;','the subject and message you write;'=>'taken da sakon da ka rubuta;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'ID din lasisin ku, ta yadda abokan ciniki masu biya ke samun fifiko;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'idan ka saka alama kawai: bayanan shafin (sigogin WordPress da PHP, jigo, plugins, da wani sashi na ragowar kuskure tare da cire kalmomin sirri da adiresoshin imel), wadanda za ka iya karantawa kafin turawa;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'idan kawai ka ƙara su: bayanan shiga rukunin yanar gizon ku, waɗanda aka adana da ɓoye kuma aka goge kwanaki 30 bayan an rufe buƙatar ku.','Privacy policy'=>'Manufofin sirri','I agree, continue'=>'Na yarda, ci gaba','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Ba a iya bincika hanyar haɗin ba.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Hakan bai yi aiki ba. Sake gwadawa.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® support sun katse wannan shafin.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Taimakon Zinn Digital® ba ya sake amince da wannan shafin.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Kun cire haɗin wannan shafin.','Connect this site to support'=>'Haɗa wannan shafin da tallafi','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'An haɗa. Mayar da martani za su je %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Ba a haɗa ba. Har yanzu za ku iya aika da roƙo tare da adireshin imel ɗin ku a ƙasa; haɗawa yana ceton ku daga buga shi a kowane lokaci.','E-mail address'=>'Adireshin imel','Your name (optional)'=>'Sunanka (ba dole ba ne)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Na yarda a haɗa wannan shafin da sabis na goyon baya na Zinn Digital®. Yana aika adreshin wannan shafin, nau\'ikan WordPress da PHP da kuma nau\'ikan plugin, kuma ana iya cire haɗin a kowane lokaci daga nan ko ta Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Haɗa','I need help'=>'Ina buƙatar taimako','Report a bug'=>'Bayar da rahoton matsala','Send feedback'=>'Aika ra\'ayi','Request a feature'=>'Nem ജi fasali','The site details could not be read.'=>'Ba a iya karanta bayanan shafin ba.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya tura buƙatarka ba. Sake gwadawa bayan \'yan mintoci kaɗan.','WordPress admin'=>'Admin na WordPress','File manager'=>'Mai sarrafa fayil','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Ra\'ayoyi da buƙatun fasali','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'An tura. Abin tunawa naku shine %s, kuma amsar mu za ta zo ta imel.','What is it about?'=>'Me ye game da shi?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Amsa zuwa (imel)','Subject'=>'Bayaani','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Me kuka yi, me kuka yi tsammanin zai faru, kuma me ya faru a maimakon haka?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Haɗa bayanan shafin (sigogi, jigo, plugins, sassan rahoton kuskure)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Ga abin da aka aika daidai','Loading…'=>'Ana lodawa...','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Shiga don tallafi (na zaɓi, an adana shi a rufe)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Ana aika da shiga tare da kalmarta ta sirri kawai. Bar wani sahu maimakon rabin cika shi.','Login address'=>'Adreshin shiga','Add a login'=>'Ƙara shiga','Create a temporary support login'=>'Ƙirƙiri shigarwar goyon baya ta ɗan lokaci','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Wani mai amfani daban ga tawagar tallafinmu, ba tare da izinin shiga masu amfani ba, shigar da kayan aiki, ko gyara lambar rubutu ba. Ana goge shi ta atomatik idan lokacinsa ya ƙare, ko a duk lokacin da ka soke shi a ƙasa.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Eh, na kwanaki %d' . "\0" . 'Eh, na kwanaki %d','Send'=>'Aika','The list could not be loaded.'=>'Ba a iya lodi lissafin ba.','That login could not be removed.'=>'Ba a iya cire wannan shiga ba.','Temporary support logins'=>'Shiga na tallafi na ɗan lokaci','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Babu. Taimako zai iya shiga cikin wannan shafin ne kawai idan ka ƙirƙiri abin shiga a nan.','expired, being removed'=>'ya kare, ana cirewa','expires %s'=>'yana ƙarewa a %s','Revoke now'=>'Soke yanzu','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Mataki na %1$d na %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Rufe rangadin','Back'=>'Baya','Everything in one place'=>'Komai a wuri guda','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Wadannan shafuka suna kai ka zuwa kowane allo na plugin din: saiti, saituna, lasisin ka, taimako da sauransu.','Help on every screen'=>'Taimako a kowane allo','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Buɗe wannan menu don samun jagora zuwa allon da kake ciki, wannan yawon buɗe ido, ko kuma don neman taimako daga gare mu.','Light or dark'=>'Mai haske ko duhu','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Zaɓi mai haske, mai duhu, ko dai daidai da na kwamfutar taka. Zaɓinka na adane domin kai kaɗai.','Welcome'=>'Marhabin','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Wannan gajeren rangadin yana nuna inda abubuwa suke. Za ku iya barinsa a kowane lokaci tare da Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Shafinka a takaice','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Ana nuna ci gaban saiti da shirin ku a nan, tare da abu na gaba da ya kamata a yi.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Tsarin ku, shafuka nawa yake rufewa, da kuma ko wannan kwafin shafikayan yana ƙidaya zuwa ga wannan iyaka.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Gwada Pro ko haɓaka','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Fara gwaji kyauta ba tare da katin banki ba, haɓaka, ko sabuntawa, duk daga nan.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Kowane fasali da tsarin da ya ƙunshi shi. Bincika wani fasali ko nuna wuri ɗaya a lokaci ɗaya.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Ƙarin bayani daga Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Fina-finan da ke aiki tare da wannan, da kuma sabis daga ƙungiyar ɗaya. Katin da kuka ɓoye a wasu allon za a iya sake nuna su anan.','Connect for faster help'=>'Haɗa don samun taimako da sauri','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Haɗawa na zaɓi ne. Yana ba ku damar aikawa da buƙatu ba tare da shigar da imeel ɗinku ba a kowane lokaci, kuma kuna iya cire haɗin a duk lokacin da kuka dama.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Nemi taimako ko ka ba da rahoton matsala','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Bayyana abin da ya faru. Ka zaɓa ko za ka haɗa bayanai kan shafin, kuma za ka iya ganin abin da ke ciki daidai da farko.','Temporary support access'=>'Samun damar tallafi na wucin gadi','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Idan goyon baya yana buƙatar duba cikin shafin ku, ƙirƙiri wani shigar da wucin gadi a nan. Yana share kansa idan ya ƙare, kuma za ku iya cire shi a duk lokacin da kuke so.','Tell us what to build'=>'Ka gaya mana abin da za mu gina','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Aiko da wani ra\'ayi, buƙatar wani abu, ko kowane irin ra\'ayi. Yana zuwa kai tsaye ga ƙungiyar.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Wannan yana ɗaukar ƴan mintoci kaɗan kuma yana saita %s domin ya yi aiki a kan wannan shafin nan take. Za ku iya sauya komai daga baya.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Kun shirya. Idan wani abu bai yi aiki yadda ake tsammani ba, muna nan da nisa danna ɗaya kawai.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Mataki na %1$d na %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Gama','Skip setup'=>'Tsallake saiti','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Wanda Neil Lock, Babban Jami\'in Gudanarwa na Zinn Digital® Ltd ya gina','Version %s'=>'Sigar %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Shafin Yanar Gizo na Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Shafin yanar gizo na Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Duba shirin Pro da farashinsa','Front-end output'=>'Fitowar gaban shafin','Class name prefix'=>'Ratabayon sunan Class','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kowane sunan aji da filogin ke bugawa akan shafukanku yana farawa da wannan gaba, ta yadda shafukan ba za su bayyana wane filogin ne ya gina su ba. Haruffa kanana ko lambobi 1 zuwa 8, wadanda suka fara da harafi.','Save'=>'Ajiye','Beta updates'=>'Sabuntawar Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Wannan shafin yana karɓar nau\'ikan beta azaman sabuntawa.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Wannan shafin yana karɓar ingantattun sassa kawai.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Canza wannan a shafin Asusu','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Ana bayar da nau\'ikan Beta ga shigarwar Pro da ke da lasisi waɗanda ke haɗa da asusun su. Da zarar an haɗa, zaku iya shiga daga shafin Asusun.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'An adana wuraren tsayawa. Shafuka za su ɗauki sabbin faɗin a gaba na gaba da suka gani.','Breakpoints'=>'Abubuwan da aka tsara','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Salon da aka saita don Tablet suna aiki har zuwa faɗin tablet, kuma salon da aka saita don Wayar hannu har zuwa faɗin wayar hannu. Salon kwamfuta yana aiki a duk sauran wurare.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Kantin kwamfuta: har zuwa (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Wayar hannju: har zuwa (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'Ajiye wuraren tsayawa','Use the default widths'=>'Yi amfani da faɗin tsoho-da-aka-sanya','Settings'=>'Saituna','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'An dakatar da juya wannan post din kafin a gama, don haka an tsallake post din. Buɗe shi don juya shi, ko kuma ka sake juya shi daga nan.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Babu wani ajiyar baya na wannan wallafe-wallafen da za a dawo da shi.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana abin da aka canza ba.','Unknown error.'=>'Kuskure wanda ba a sani ba.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Ba a bincika wani tsohon abun ciki ba tukuna.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Maido da tsohon abun ciki: %1$d na %2$d posts.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Canza tsohuwar abun ciki: %1$d na posts %2$d.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'An gama sauyawa: %1$d an dawo da su, %2$d sun gaza.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Canjin ya kammala: %1$d an canza, %2$d ba su canza ba, %3$d sun gaza.','Legacy content'=>'Tsohon abun ciki','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'An canza shafukan da aka yi da tsofaffin sifofin Page Builder Sandwich zuwa blocks a bango. Ana yin madadin kowanne post a gaba, don haka ana iya mayar da kowanecanji zuwa yadda yake.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Har yanzu post %d yana dauke da tsohon abun ciki.' . "\0" . 'Mawallafan %d har yanzu suna ɗauke da tsohon abun ciki.','%d post has a backup.'=>'Post %d yana da ajiyar baya.' . "\0" . '%d posts suna da madadin ajiyar bayanai.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Ba a iya sarrafa rubutu %d ba' . "\0" . 'Ba a iya sarrafa wallafe-wallafen %d ba','Post %d'=>'Rubutu na %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'An fara sauyawa. Yana ci gaba a bango; za ku iya barin wannan shafin.','Convert legacy content'=>'Maida tsohon abun ciki sabon salo','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Sake dawo da kowane gidan yanar gizon da aka maida zuwa tsohuwar sigarsa? Canje-canjen da aka yi wa waɗannan gidajen yanar gizon tun lokacin da aka maida su za su ɓace.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'An fara sauyawa. Yana ci gaba a bango; zaku iya barin wannan shafin.','Undo all conversions'=>'Soke duk juyawar','Item'=>'Abubuwa','Open when the page loads'=>'Buɗe lokacin da shafin ya loda','Title is a heading'=>'Takeken taken heading ne','Make the title a heading when the items are sections of the page, so visitors can jump between them.'=>'Sanya taken ya zama kanun labari idan abubuwan sassan shafin ne, ta yadda baƙi za su iya tsallaka tsakaninsu.','Heading %d'=>'Take %d','Question or section title'=>'Tambaya ko taken sashin','Accordion'=>'Fadakarwa','Only one item open at a time'=>'Abu ɗaya kawai a buɗe a lokaci ɗaya','Mark up as FAQ for search engines'=>'Yiwa alama a matsayin FAQ don injunan bincike','Adds FAQ structured data built from the titles (questions) and their text (answers).'=>'Yana ƙara bayanan tsarin FAQ da aka gina daga taken (tambayoyi) da rubutun su (amsoshi).','Alert'=>'Sanarwa','Information'=>'Bayani','Success'=>'Nasara','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Ana sanar da gargaɗi da kurakurai ga masu amfani da mai karanta allo nan take; ana karanta sanarwar bayani da nasara idan sun gama abin da suke yi.','Show icon'=>'Nuna alamar icon','Visitors can close it'=>'Masu ziyara za su iya rufe shi','Title (optional)'=>'Take (zaɓi)','Write the message…'=>'Rubuta sako...','Centre'=>'Tsakiya','Badge'=>'Lakabi','Colour'=>'Launi','Theme accent'=>'Launin jigo','Neutral'=>'Tsaka-tsaki','Position'=>'Matsayi','Label'=>'Alamar','Booking calendar'=>'Kalandar ajiyar wuri','Service'=>'Ayyuka','Booking page address'=>'Adireshin shafin ajiyar wuri','For example %s'=>'Misali kamar %s','What the calendar is for, read out by screen readers and shown under it.'=>'Abin da kalanda yake don, mai karanta allo yana karantawa kuma ana nuna shi a ƙarƙashinsa.','This is not a %s booking page address, so nothing will show on the page.'=>'Wannan ba adireshin shafin ajiyar %s ba ne, don haka babu abin da zai bayyana a shafin.','Preview the calendar'=>'Yi duban kalandar kafin bugawa','Link address'=>'Adireshin mahada','The button shows when it has both a label and an address.'=>'Maɓallin yana bayyana lokacin da yake da lakabi da adireshi duka biyu.','Open in a new tab'=>'Buɗe a cikin sabon shafin yanar gizo','Call to action'=>'Kirki ga aiki','Layout'=>'Tsari','Buttons below'=>'Maɓallai a ƙasa','Buttons beside the text'=>'Maɓallan da ke kusa da rubutun','Alignment'=>'Daidaita shafi','Main button'=>'Babban maballi','Second button'=>'Maɓallin na biyu','Heading…'=>'Taken...','One sentence on why…'=>'Sentensi guda daya kan dalilin da ya sa...','Second button (optional)'=>'Maɓall na biyu (ba dole ba ne)','Checklist'=>'Jerin abubuwan dubawa','Tick colour'=>'Launi na alamar dubawa','Lines'=>'Layi','Line %d'=>'Layi %d','Task…'=>'Aiki...','Add line'=>'Ƙara layin','Language'=>'Harshe','Detect automatically'=>'Gano da kansa','No highlighting'=>'Babu haske','File name'=>'Sunan fayil','Shown above the code, for example functions.php.'=>'An nuna sama da lamba, misali functions.php.','Line numbers'=>'Lambar layi','Copy button'=>'Kwafin maɓalli','Wrap long lines'=>'Rufe dogayen layuka','Write or paste code…'=>'Rubuta ko liƙe lamba…','Text'=>'Rubutu','Columns'=>'Ginshiƙai','Highlight %s'=>'Haske %s','Add column'=>'Ƙara shafi','Rows'=>'Layuka','Row %d'=>'Layla %d','Add row'=>'Ƙara jere','Caption (what is being compared)'=>'Taken (abin da ake kwatantawa)','Cell type: %s. Change'=>'Nau\'in tantani: %s. Canza','Phone call'=>'Kiran waya','Text message'=>'Sakon rubutu','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Buttons'=>'Maɓallai','Phone number, with country code'=>'Lambar waya, tare da lambar ƙasa','Button text'=>'Rubutun maɓalli','Remove this button'=>'Cire wannan maballin','Add a button'=>'Ƙara maɓalli','WhatsApp message to start with (optional)'=>'Sako na WhatsApp don farawa (na zaɓi)','Contact buttons'=>'Maɓallان tuntuɓa','Add a phone number, an email address or a WhatsApp number in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara lamba ta waya, adireshin imel ko lambar WhatsApp a gefen shafi.','Dual heading'=>'Biyu shugaba','Heading level'=>'Matakin taken rubutu','Use H1 once per page, for its main title.'=>'Yi amfani da H1 sau ɗaya a kowace shafi, don babban taken ta.','Second part look'=>'Kashi na biyu dubi','Accent colour'=>'Launin jaddadawa','Gradient'=>'Mai launi biyu','Outline'=>'Tsari','Underline'=>'Ƙara layin ƙasa','Second part on its own line'=>'Bangare na biyu a kan nasa layin','First part'=>'Sashe na farko','second part'=>'bangare na biyu','Marker pen'=>'Alamar alama','Thick underline'=>'Kewaye mai kauri','Background'=>'Bayan Fage','Highlight'=>'Hau da','Remove highlight'=>'Cire hasken','Drop cap'=>'Harafi mai girma','Large first letter'=>'Babban harafi na farko','For the first letter in a box, choose the "Drop cap in a box" style.'=>'Don harafi na farko a cikin akwati, zaɓi salon "Drop cap in a box".','Drop cap in a box'=>'Babban harafi a cikin akwati','Accent bar'=>'Sandar launi','Pull quote (accent bar)'=>'Sanarwa (mashigar launi)','A quote from the text, set large beside a coloured bar to draw the eye.'=>'Wani zance daga cikin rubutun, an sa shi da girma kusa da wani mashaya mai launi don jawo hankali.','quote'=>'magana','Feature list'=>'Jerin abubuwa masu muhimmanci','On phones the features always stack.'=>'A kan wayoyi, siffofin suna lodi a koda ya kasance.','Features'=>'Abubuwan da ke ciki','Feature %d'=>'Siffa %d','Own icon'=>'Mallakar alama','Feature…'=>'Fasali...','Describe it…'=>'Bayyana shi...','Add feature'=>'Ƙara fasali','Install and activate Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms or Fluent Forms, then choose one of its forms here.'=>'Sanya kuma a kunna Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms ko kuma Fluent Forms, sannan ka zabi daya daga cikin fom din a nan.','Form plugin'=>'Fatar plugin','Choose…'=>'Zaɓa...','Form'=>'Firamare','Choose a form…'=>'Zaɓi fom...','%s has no forms yet'=>'%s ba ta da fom ko daya yanzu','%s is not active on this site, so this form cannot be shown.'=>'%s ba ya aiki a wannan shafin, sab