baƙi ba sa ganin komai a nan.','New password'=>'Sabon kalmar sirri','Set the password'=>'Saita kalmar sirri','Password set. Save the page to apply it; visitors who had unlocked it will need the new one.'=>'An saita kalmar sirri. A ajiyဲ shafin don amfani da ita; baƙi da suka buɗe shi za su buƙaci sabuwa.','If Page Builder Sandwich is ever switched off, this content is shown to everyone.'=>'Idan an kashe Page Builder Sandwich, ana nuna wannan abun ciki ga kowa.','Message above the password form (optional)'=>'Sako a sama da fom ɗin kalmar sirri (na zaɓi)','Button'=>'Maɓalli','Visit site'=>'Ziyarci shafin','Style'=>'Salo','Size'=>'Girma','Affiliate button'=>'Maɓallin abokin tarayya','Give the button its text and the offer’s address in the sidebar.'=>'Ba maɓallin da rubutunsa da kuma adireshin tayin a cikin mashigar gefe.','Age check'=>'Binciken shekaru','Put this block on every page that needs it, or in your header template part to cover the whole site.'=>'Sanya wannan tubalin a kowane shafi da ke buƙatar shi, ko kuma a cikin sashin samfurin kai (header) don rufe daukacin shafin yanar gizon.','Minimum age'=>'Mafi ƙarancin shekaru','Ask for'=>'Nemi don','A yes or no answer'=>'Amsar eh ko a\'a','The date of birth'=>'Ranar haihuwa','Remember the answer for (days)'=>'Ka tuna amsar na tsawon (days) kwanaki','Texts'=>'Rubututtu','Leave a text empty to use the standard one. {age} is replaced by the minimum age.'=>'Bar rubutu babu komai don amfani da wanda aka saba. Ana maye gurbin {age} da mafi ƙarancin shekaru.','Question'=>'Tambaya','When the visitor is too young'=>'Lokacin da baƙon ya yi ƙuruciya sosai','Countries'=>'Kasashe','A different minimum age for visitors from a country, or 0 to close the site to it. The country comes from your host or CDN (for example Cloudflare); where it is unknown, the minimum age above applies. A page cache must keep one copy per country for these rules to apply to cached pages.'=>'Wani ƙaramin shekaru daban na baƙi daga wata ƙasa, ko 0 don rufe rukunin yanar gizon ga ita. Ƙasar tana fitowa ne daga mai masaukin baki ko CDN (misali Cloudflare); inda ba a sani ba, ƙaramin shekarun da ke sama ya shafa. Dole ne ajiya ta wucin gadi ta shafi ta adana kwafi ɗaya a kowace ƙasa don waɗannan dokoki su yi aiki kan shafukan da aka adana.','Add a country'=>'Ƙara ƙasa','Country code (two letters)'=>'Lambar ƙasa (haruffa biyu)','For example US, GB, DE.'=>'Misali US, GB, DE.','Minimum age (0: closed)'=>'Karancin shekaru (0: a rufe)','Age gate'=>'Ƙofa mai shekaru','The age question shows here.'=>'Tambayar shekarun tana bayyana anan.','Changing words'=>'Canza kalmomi','Word'=>'Kalma','Add a word'=>'Ƙara kalma','Animated headline'=>'Kanun labarai mai motsi','Text before'=>'Rubutun da ke gaba','Text after'=>'Rubutun bayan','Effect'=>'Tasiri','Fade'=>'Fara dusashewa','Slide up'=>'Zame sama','Typing'=>'Rubutawa','Time per word (milliseconds)'=>'Lokaci a kowace kalma (millisekan)','Add the words that change in the block settings.'=>'Ƙara kalmomin da ke canzawa a cikin saitunan katanga.','Typewriter'=>'Typewriter','Words fade in'=>'Kalmomi suna bayyana a hankali','Words rise in'=>'Kalmomi suna tashi a','Plays once, when the text scrolls into view. Visitors who ask their device for less motion see the text still.'=>'Ana kunna sau ɗaya, lokacin da rubutun ya bayyana yayin gungurawa. Baƙi waɗanda suka buƙaci na\'urarsu ta rage motsi za su ga rubutun a tsaye.','Speed'=>'Gudun gudu','Slow'=>'Mai sannu a hankali','Normal'=>'Na yau da kullum','Fast'=>'Mai sauri','Write the text to animate…'=>'Rubuta rubutun da za a yi wa rai...','Audio player'=>'Na\'urar kunna sauti','Show or album name'=>'Sunan shiri ko kundin waƙoƙi','Replace artwork'=>'Maye gurbin zanen fasaha','Choose artwork'=>'Zaɓi zane','Add an episode'=>'Ƙara wani yanki','Choose audio file'=>'Zaɓi fayil ɗin sauti','Replace audio file'=>'Maye gurbin fayil ɗin sauti','or its address'=>'ko adireshinsa','Add episodes in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara sassa a mashigar gefe.','Author box'=>'A