a','To'=>'Zuwa','Remove these hours on %s'=>'Cire waɗannan awanni a ranar %s','Add hours (for a break)'=>'Ƙara awanni (domin hutawa)','Copy Monday to Tuesday–Friday'=>'Kwafi daga Litinin zuwa Litinin–Juma\'a','Hours that end after midnight (18:00 to 02:00) belong to the day they start. Times are in the site’s time zone (Settings › General).'=>'Sa\'o\'in da suka ƙare bayan tsakiyar dare (18:00 zuwa 02:00) na cikin ranar da suka fara ne. Lokutan suna cikin yankin lokaci na shafin ne (Saituna › Janar).','Display'=>'Nuna','Empty: read out by screen readers only.'=>'Bace: masu karatun allo ne kawai ke karanta shi.','Say whether it is open now'=>'Faɗi ko a buɗe yake yanzu','Highlight today'=>'Haskaka na yau','Note under the hours'=>'Bayani a karkashin awanni','Closed on public holidays.'=>'A rufe a kwanakin hutun jama\'a.','Offers'=>'Kyauta','Add an offer'=>'Ƙara tayi','New offer'=>'Sabon tayi','Table'=>'Tebur','Caption'=>'Takeƙe','Shown above the table and read out by screen readers.'=>'An nuna sama da teburin kuma masu karatun allo ke karanta shi.','Rank column'=>'Matsayi na shafi','Rating column'=>'Shafin ƙima','Highlights column'=>'Ginshiƙin jigo','Notice under the table'=>'Sanarwa a ƙarƙashin teburin','Casino comparison table'=>'Teburin kwatancen gidan caca','Add the offers in the sidebar, best first.'=>'Ƙara tayin a cikin sandar gefe, mafi kyau a farko.','Kind'=>'Nau\'i','Bars'=>'Shafuka','Line'=>'Layi','Pie (first series only)'=>'Biredi (jerin farko kawai)','Shown above the chart and read out as its name.'=>'An nuna a sama da jadawalin kuma ana karanta shi azaman sunansa.','Before each value'=>'Kafin kowane ƙima','For example $ or €.'=>'Misali $ ko €.​','After each value'=>'Bayan kowane ƙima','For example kg, or the percent sign.'=>'Misali kg, ko alamar kashi dari.','Show a legend'=>'Nuna labulen bayani','Print each value on the chart'=>'Bugaje kowane daraja akan jadawalin','Height'=>'Tsawon','Short'=>'Gajere','Tall'=>'Mai tsayi','Add categories and numbers below to draw the chart.'=>'Ƙara nau\'ikan da lambobi a kasa don zana jadawalin.','Category'=>'Rukuni','Add category'=>'Ƙara rukunin yanar gizo','Add series'=>'Ƙara jerin shiri','Click to share quote'=>'Danna domin raba ambato','Quote'=>'Kwato','X username'=>'Sunan mai amfani na X','Added as "via @name". Without the @.'=>'An ƙara azaman "via @name". Ba tare da @ ba.','Link to share'=>'Hadin gwiwa don rabawa','Left empty, the address of this page.'=>'Idan aka bar shi ba komai, adireshin wannan shafin.','Write the quote in the block settings.'=>'Rubuta ambaton a cikin saitunan tubalan.','Content switcher'=>'Canjin abun ciki','Name for screen readers'=>'Suna ga masu karanta allon kwamfuta','What the switch chooses, for example "Billing period".'=>'Abinda sauyawa ke zaɓa, alal misali "Lokacin lissafi".','Add an option'=>'Ƙara zaɓi','Countdown'=>'Lokaci mai ragowa','Count down to'=>'Ƙidaya zuwa ga','A date and time'=>'Wani kwanan wata da lokaci','A time after each visitor arrives'=>'Lokacin da kowane baƙo ya isa','Ends at'=>'Ya ƙare a','In the time zone set under Settings, General.'=>'A yankin lokaci da aka saita a Settings, General.','Hours after the first visit'=>'Awanni bayan ziyarar farko','Text above'=>'Rubutun da ke sama','Text once it has ended'=>'Rubutu da zarar ya ƙare','Show seconds'=>'Nuna daƙiƙa','Choose the date and time it counts down to.'=>'Zaɓi ranar da lokacin da ƙidayar lokaci za ta ƙare.','Counter'=>'Mai ƙidaya','Count to'=>'Ƙirga zuwa','Count from'=>'Ida daga','Decimal places'=>'Wuraren goma','Before the number'=>'Kafin lamba','For example "$".'=>'Misali kamar "$".','After the number'=>'Bayan lamba','For example "+" or "%".'=>'Misali "+" ko "%".','Thousands separator'=>'Mai raba dubbai','Counting time (milliseconds)'=>'Ƙididdigar lokaci (miliyasekondi)','Set the number to count to.'=>'Saita lamba don kirgawa zuwa gare ta.','Coupon code'=>'Lambar rangwame','Description'=>'Bayani','Expires'=>'Ya ƙare','As you want it shown, for example "31 December".'=>'Kamar yadda kake son a nuna shi, alal misali "31 December".','Enter the code in the block settings.'=>'Shigar da lambar a cikin saitunan tubali.','Prices'=>'Farashoshi','Show as'=>'Nuna a matsayin','Scrolling ticker'=>'Mai guduwa','Cards'=>'Katinan biya','Price chart (one coin)'=>'Jadawalin farashi (tsabar kudi daya)','Period'=>'Lokaci','24 hours'=>'Awanni 24','7 days'=>'Kwana 7','30 days'=>'Kwana 30','90 days'=>'Kwana 90','Currency'=>'Kudin waje','Coins'=>'Tsabar kudi','Prices come from CoinGecko and are kept on your site for a few minutes, so visitors never wait for it.'=>'Farashin sun fito ne daga CoinGecko kuma ana adana su a shafin ku na \'yan mintuna kadan, ta yadda ba za a taba sa masu ziyara su jira su ba.','Crypto prices'=>'Farashin Crypto','Choose the coins in the sidebar.'=>'Zaɓi tsabar kuɗi a cikin mashigar gefe.','Cursor effect'=>'Sakamakon linzami kwamfuta','A ring follows the pointer'=>'Wani zobe yana bin alamar nuni','A soft spotlight'=>'Wuri mai haske mai laushi','A trail of dots'=>'Wani layin ɗigo-ɗigo','Where'=>'Inda','Over this section'=>'Aikin wannan sashi','Over the whole page'=>'A duk shafin','The real pointer always stays. The effect is off on touch screens and for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'Manunin gaskiya koyaushe yana tsayawa. Tasirin a kashe yake a allon taɓawa da kuma ga baƙi waɗanda suka roƙi na\'urarsu ta yi motsi kaɗan.','Switch'=>'Canzawa','Number'=>'Lambar','That has no rows under its first line. The first line is used for the column names.'=>'Wannan ba shi da sauran layuka a ƙarƙashin layinsa na farko. Ana amfani da layin farko don sunayen ginshiƙai.','Import a CSV file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin CSV','Or paste CSV'=>'Ko a manna CSV','Comma, semicolon or tab separated. The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces the table.'=>'Raba da waƙafi, aminiya ko tab. Layin farko yana da sunayen shafi. Shigo da kaya yana maye gurbin teburin.','Import pasted CSV'=>'Shigo da CSV da aka manna','Says what the table shows