unan da aka daidaita','Even grid'=>'Tsarin jadawali mai daidaito','Open images in a lightbox'=>'Bude hotuna a cikin lightbox','Show captions'=>'Nuna fassara','Justified gallery'=>'Hoton da aka daidaita','Rows of images of equal height, each as wide as its shape.'=>'Layuka na hotuna masu tsawo iri ɗaya, kowanne yana da faɗi daidai da siffarsa.','Points'=>'Makiƙa','Point'=>'Nuna','Add a point'=>'Ƙara wani ma\'ana','Across (%)'=>'Akwai (%)','Down (%)'=>'Kasa (%)','Image'=>'Hoto','Alternative text'=>'Rubutun madadin','Hotspots'=>'Wuraren da aka fi ziyarta','Choose an image, then add points in the block settings.'=>'Zabi hototo, sannan ka kara maki a cikin saitunan tubalin.','Panels'=>'Alluna','Add a panel'=>'Ƙara fanka','Panel %d'=>'Firamare %d','Choose image'=>'Zaɓi hoton','Replace image'=>'Canja hoton','Link (optional)'=>'Hadin gwiwa (ba dole ba ne)','Add panels in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara allon gefe a cikin mashigin gefe.','The form shows only while “Anyone can register” is on in Settings › General.'=>'Fom ɗin yana nuna ne kawai yayin da "Kowa zai iya yin rajista" yake a kunne a Saituna › Janar.','“Remember me” box'=>'Akwatin “Tuna da ni”','Lost password link'=>'Hanyar haɗin da ta ɓace ko manta kalmar sirri','Link to create an account'=>'Hanyar haɗi don ƙirƙirar lissafi','After logging in, go to'=>'Bayan shiga, je zuwa','Leave empty to come back to this page.'=>'Bar shi a banza domin komawa zuwa wannan shafin.','Logo'=>'Tambarin alama','Add a logo'=>'Ƙara tambari','The company name.'=>'Sunan kamfanin.','Logo grid'=>'Jerin tambura','Grey until hovered'=>'Launin toka har sai an sanya linzami a kai','Add a logo in the block settings.'=>'Ƙara tambari a cikin saitunan baki.','Logo marquee'=>'Logo marquee','Grey logos'=>'Launin launin toka','Lottie animation'=>'Rayarwar Lottie','Animation file chosen.'=>'An zabi fayil din motsi.','Upload or choose an animation file in the block settings.'=>'Loda ko ka zaɓi fayil ɗin motsi a cikin saitunan shingen.','The file could not be uploaded.'=>'Ba a iya loda fayil ɗin ba.','Animation file'=>'Fayil din motsi','— Choose —'=>'— Zabi —','Upload a Lottie file (.json)'=>'Sanya fayil ɗin Lottie (.json)','Playback'=>'Watsawa','What the animation shows, for people who cannot see it.'=>'Abin da raye-rayen ke nunawa, ga mutanen da ba za su iya ganin sa ba.','Play'=>'Kunna','When it scrolls into view'=>'Lokacin da ya shiga cikin gani','As soon as the page loads'=>'Da zaran shafin ya loda','While the pointer is over it'=>'Yayin da mai nuna aiki yake a kai','Loop'=>'Madauka','Marquee'=>'Marquee','Moves'=>'Matsugoji','Towards the start of a line'=>'A farkon layi','Towards the end of a line'=>'A karshen layi','Between items'=>'Tsakanin abubuwa','Nothing'=>'Babu komai','Name read out by screen readers'=>'Sunan da mai karanta allo ke karantawa','Visitors get a pause button, and it stops while they point at it. It stays still for visitors who ask for less motion.'=>'Baƙi suna samun maɓallin dakatarwa, kuma yana tsayawa yayin da suke nuna shi. Yana kasancewa a tsaye ga baƙi waɗanda suka nemi ƙarancin motsi.','Item %d'=>'Abu %d','Remove item %d'=>'Cire abu %d','Add item'=>'Ƙara abu','Mega menu'=>'Babban menu','Show under'=>'Nuna a ƙarƙashin','The top-level menu item that opens this panel.'=>'Babban abin da ke cikin menu wanda ke buɗe wannan kwamitin.','Choose an item…'=>'Zabi wani abu...','Width'=>'Fadi','As wide as its content'=>'Kamar fadin abubuwan da ke cikinta','As wide as the menu bar'=>'Kamar faɗin babban menu','Mega menu for “%s”'=>'Babban menu na “%s”','Mega menu: choose its menu item in the sidebar.'=>'Babban menu: zaɓi abin menu nasa a gefe.','Phones'=>'Wayoyin hannu','Accordion on phones'=>'Accordion a kan wayoyi','On narrow screens each tab becomes a section that opens and closes on its own.'=>'A kan fuskoki ƙanana kowane shafin yana zama sashe wanda yake buɗewa kuma yake rufe kansa.','3D model'=>'Samfurin 3D','Choose a model (GLB or glTF)'=>'Zaɓi wani samfuri (GLB ko glTF)','Description (required)'=>'Bayani (ana buƙata)','What the model shows: it is what a screen reader announces.'=>'Abin da samfurin ke nunawa: abin da mai karanta allo ke sanarwa kenan.','Poster image shown while it loads'=>'Hoton da ake nunawa yayin da yake lodi','Turn slowly on its own'=>'Juya a hankali da kansa','Offer "view in your space" (AR) on phones'=>'Ba da "dubawa a sararin samaniya" (AR) a kan wayoyin komai da ruwanka','Choose a 3D model in the sidebar.'=>'Zaɓi samfurin 3D a cikin bango na gefe.','Choose a menu…'=>'Zaɓi menu…','Only people who can edit the site’s menus can choose one here.'=>'Mutanen da za su iya gyara menus na shafin ne kawai za su iya zaɓar ɗaya a nan.','Navigation menu'=>'Menüwar bincike','Choose which WordPress menu to show.'=>'Zaɓi wani menu na WordPress da za a nuna.','This site has no menus yet. Create one, then choose it here.'=>'Wannan shafin ba shi da menu tukuna. Ƙirƙiri ɗaya, sannan ka zaɓi shi a nan.','Edit menus'=>'Gyara menu','Tells screen reader users which menu this is, for example “Main” or “Footer”.'=>'Yana gaya wa masu amfani da mai karanta allo wane menu ne wannan, alal misali “Babba” ko “Na Ƙasa”.','Direction'=>'Hanyar da za a bi','In a row'=>'A jere','In a column'=>'A cikin ginshiƙi','Mobile menu button'=>'Maɓallin menu na wayar hannu','Below this width the menu folds into a button that opens it over the page.'=>'Ƙasa da wannan faɗin, menu ɗin zai ninke ya zama maballin da ke buɗe shi a kan shafin.','On phones'=>'A kan wayoyi','On phones and tablets'=>'A kan wayoyi da kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka','Always'=>'Kullum','Never'=>'Ba a taɓa ba','Open submenus'=>'Buɗe ƙananan menu','When the arrow is clicked'=>'Lokacin da aka danna kibiyar','On hover, or when the arrow is clicked'=>'A lokacin da aka sanya linzami a kai, ko lokacin da aka danna kibiyar','Mega menus'=>'Manyan menu','A mega menu shows any blocks under a top-level item, instead of its submenu. Add a panel below the menu and choose its item.'=>'Babban menu yana nuna kowane tubali a ƙarƙashin abin