item in the block settings.'=>'Ƙara wani abu a cikin saitunan bazuwar.','Plans'=>'Shirye-shirye','Add a plan'=>'Ƙara tsari','Plan name'=>'Sunan shiri','Short description'=>'Takaitaccen bayani','A figure such as 19 or 19.99, or a word such as Free.'=>'Adadi kamar 19 ko 19.99, ko wata kalma kamar Kyauta.','After the price'=>'Bayan farashin','For example "/ month". Left empty, the billing period is used.'=>'Misali "/ wata". Idan aka bar shi babu komai, za a yi amfani da lokacin biyan kuɗi.','Yearly price'=>'Farashin shekara-shekara','Shown when the visitor switches to yearly billing.'=>'Ana nuna wannan lokacin da mai ziyara ya koma ga biyan kuɗi na shekara-shekara.','After the yearly price'=>'Bayan farashin shekara-shekara','Add a feature'=>'Ƙara wani fasali','Open the link in a new tab'=>'Buɗe mahaɗin a sabon shafin yanar gizo','Highlight this plan'=>'Haskaka wannan tsari','A short label above the plan, such as "Most popular".'=>'Wani gajeren lakabi a sama da shirin, kamar "Mafi shahara".','Pricing table'=>'Teburin farashi','Currency symbol'=>'Alamar kudin kasa','Monthly / yearly switch'=>'Canjin wata-wata / shekara-shekara','Shows a switch when at least one plan has a yearly price.'=>'Ana nuna maɓallin canji idan aƙalla shiri ɗaya yana da farashin shekara.','Monthly button text'=>'Rubutun maɓallin na wata-wata','Yearly button text'=>'Rubutun maɓallin na shekara-shekara','Yearly saving'=>'Tanadin shekara','For example "Save 20%".'=>'Misali "Ajiye 20%".','Add a plan in the block settings.'=>'Ƙara wani shiri a cikin saitunan katanga.','Out of'=>'Daga cikin','Show'=>'Nuna','A percentage'=>'Kashi dari','The value out of the total'=>'Darajar daga cikin jimlar','Ring'=>'Sauti','Thickness'=>'Kauri','Thin'=>'Maraƙi','Thick'=>'Mai kauri','Label (optional)'=>'Lakabi (na zaɓi)','Promo bar'=>'Mashayar talla','Top, stays in view'=>'Sama, yana nan a gani','Bottom of the screen'=>'Kasan allo','Where it is placed'=>'Inda aka sanya shi','Colours'=>'Launi','Accent'=>'Harshe','Write the announcement in the block settings.'=>'Rubuta sanarwar a cikin saitunan bango.','One per line'=>'Ɗaya a kowane layi','Headings'=>'Rubutattun batutuwa','Add the pros and cons in the sidebar, one per line.'=>'Ƙara fa\'idodi da rashin fa\'idodi a cikin sandar gefe, ɗaya a kowane layi.','Optional, for example “Reading time:”.'=>'Na zaɓi, alal misali “Lokacin karatu:”.','Format'=>'Tsara fasali','5 minutes read'=>'Mintuna 5 na karatu','5 min read'=>'Mintoci 5 na karatu','Reading speed (words a minute)'=>'Saurin karatu (kalmomi a minti daya)','How long the post takes to read shows here.'=>'Yadda tsawon lokacin da za a dauka don karanta wallafar yana nuna a nan.','Score'=>'Maki','Overall score'=>'Jimlar maki','Verdict'=>'Hukunci','Criteria'=>'Ka\'idoji','Add a criterion'=>'Ƙara ma\'auni','Criterion'=>'Ma\'auni','Review score'=>'Makiya na bitar da','Set the score in the sidebar.'=>'Saita maki a cikin mashigin gefe.','Reviews'=>'Bita','Google and Trustpilot'=>'Google da Trustpilot','Lowest rating shown'=>'An nuna ƙimar da ta fi ƙasa','Only 5-star reviews.'=>'Sharhin tauraro 5 kawai.','Reviews below this are not shown.'=>'Ba a nuna bituttuka da ke ƙasa da wannan.','Order'=>'Yi oda','Newest first'=>'Wadanda suka fi sabunta a farko','Best first'=>'Mafi kyau farko','Show the date'=>'Nuna kwanan wata','Show the overall rating under them'=>'Nuna jimillar ƙimar da ke ƙarƙashinsu','Google and Trustpilot details (Site design › Reviews)'=>'Bayanan Google da Trustpilot (Tsarin shafi › Bita)','A grid of cards'=>'Wani grid na katuna','A slider'=>'Wani nunfashi','A badge: the overall rating'=>'Wani alama: jimillar ƙimar','Notice'=>'Sanarwa','Help link'=>'Hanyar haɗi ta taimako','Show the age badge'=>'Nuna alamar shekaru','Link the national help service'=>'Haɗa sabis na taimako na ƙasa','For visitors from the UK, the US, Australia, Germany, France and Sweden, link that country’s help service. Check them against your licence, and add other countries below.'=>'Ga baƙi daga Birtaniya, US, Ostiriliya, Jamus, Faransa da Sweden, haɗa sabis na taimako na wannan ƙasar. Duba su da lasisin ku, kuma ku ƙara wasu ƙasashe a ƙasa.','Responsible gambling notice'=>'Sanarwar yin caca daidai','The notice shows here.'=>'Sanarwar tana nunawa a nan.','For example “Q3 2026” or “Spring”.'=>'Misali “Q3 2026” ko “Spring”.','A board: planned, in progress, done'=>'Wani allo: an tsara, yana ci gaba, an gama','One list, each item with its status'=>'Jeriri daya, kowanne abu da matsayinsa','Column heading level'=>'Matsayi na shafi','Add the first item in the sidebar.'=>'Ƙara abu na farko a cikin mashigar gefe.','Hidden labels are still read out by screen readers.'=>'Ana ci gaba da karanta ɓoyayyun lakabi ta hanyar masu karanta allo.','Placeholder'=>'Gurbin abu','Icon instead of button text'=>'Alamar maimakon rubutun maɓalli','Search in'=>'Bincika a cikin','The whole website'=>'Dukan gidan yanar gizon','Device share menu'=>'Menu raba na\'ura','Share to'=>'Raba zuwa','Share bar'=>'Ma\'ajiyar rabawa','For example "Share". Left empty, no label is shown.'=>'Misali "Raba". Idan aka bar shi babu komai, ba a nuna lakabi ba.','Floating at the side (wide screens)'=>'Mai iyo a gefe (nunfadi masu fadi)','The buttons appear once the page has an address (save it as a draft).'=>'Maɓallan za su bayyana da zaran shafin yana da adireshin (a ajiyhe shi a matsayin zane).','Networks'=>'Cibiyoyin Sadarwa','Device share button'=>'Maɓallin raba na\'ura','Phones and some browsers offer their own share sheet; the button appears only where one exists.'=>'Wayoyin hannu da wasu burauzoci suna ba da takardar rabawa ta su; maɓallin yana bayyana ne kawai inda akwai shi.','Look'=>'Duba','Show network names'=>'Nuna sunayen cibiyar sadarwa','Shape'=>'Siffanta','Rounded'=>'Zagakke','Circle'=>'Da\'ira','Square'=>'Murabba\'i','Edit images (%d)'=>'Gyara hotuna (%d)','Choose images'=>'Zaɓi hotuna','Content type'=>'Nau\'in abun ciki','Items per page'=>'Abubuwa a kowane shafi','Only these categories'=>'Waɗannan nau\'ikan 