ress starting with https://.'=>'Ba da gajeren hanyar haɗi suna, da kuma tayin cikakken adireshin da ya fara da https://.','The short link could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana gajeren mahadar ba.','Offer address'=>'Adireshin tallace-tallace','Your affiliate link. Links to offers are always marked as sponsored for search engines.'=>'Hadin gwiwar ku na abokai (affiliate link). Ana nuna hanyoyin haɗi zuwa ga tayi a matsayin wadanda aka dauki nauyin su a injunan bincike koyaushe.','Go through a short link'=>'Bi ta ɗan gajeren mahaɗi','Visitors see a short address on your site, and every click is counted in Short links.'=>'Masu ziyara suna ganin ɗan gajeren adireshin a shafin ku, kuma ana ƙidaya kowane dannawa a cikin Gajerun hanyoyin haɗi.','Visitors will see %s'=>'Masu ziyara za su ga %s','Or make a new one, named'=>'Ko a ƙirƙiri sabo, mai suna','spin-palace'=>'spin-palace','Create short link from the address'=>'Ƙirƙiri gajeren hanyar haɗi daga adireshin','Height before the button'=>'Tsawon kafin maɓallin','Button text when open'=>'Maɓallin rubutu lokacin budewa','Header'=>'Kan rubutu','Sticky'=>'Mai mannewa','Stays at the top of the screen while visitors scroll.'=>'Yana nan a saman allo yayin da baƙi ke gungurawa.','Transparent'=>'Mai gani ta ciki','Lies over the first section of the page, and takes the site’s background colour once the page scrolls. Give the first section enough space at the top.'=>'Yana kwance a saman sashe na farko na shafin, kuma yana ɗaukar launi na asali na shafin da zarar shafin ya yi gungurawa. Ka ba sashe na farko isasshen sarari a sama.','Slides come from'=>'Hotunan nunawa sun fito daga','Blocks I add'=>'Bulolin da na ƙara','Posts'=>'Rubutattun Sako','Products (WooCommerce)'=>'Kayayyaki (WooCommerce)','Slide'=>'Zazzage','Ken Burns (slow zoom, images)'=>'Ken Burns (mafi ƙarancin girma sannu a hankali, hotuna)','Slides in view: desktop'=>'Slide a gani: kwamfuta ta tebur','Slides in view: tablet'=>'Faifan faifai da ake gani: kwamfutar hannu','Slides in view: phone'=>'Nunnutsu a kan allo: wayar salula','What the slides are, for example "Customer stories".'=>'Abubuwan da ke cikin faifan hoto suke, alal misali "Labaran abokan ciniki".','Image slider'=>'Hoton mai zamewa','Images from the media library, one after another.'=>'Hotuna daga ɗakin karatu na kafofin watsa labarai, ɗaya bayan ɗaya.','Post slider'=>'Bayanin gundarin hotuna','Product slider'=>'Fifikaffen samfurin','WooCommerce products as a carousel.'=>'Kayayyakin WooCommerce azaman carousel.','Ken Burns slideshow'=>'Nunushin Ken Burns','Full-width images with a slow zoom, fading from one to the next.'=>'Hotunan faɗin fuska tare da jinkirin zuƙowa, masu shuɗewa daga ɗaya zuwa na gaba.','Recent sales notices — example, shown only in the editor'=>'Sanarwar tallace-tallace na baya-bayan nan — misali, ana nuna shi a cikin edita kawai','First name from Town bought Product'=>'Sunan farko daga Town ya sayi Product','2 hours ago'=>'A sa\'o\'i 2 da suka wuce','Orders'=>'Umarni','Orders from'=>'Orders daga','WooCommerce and Easy Digital Downloads'=>'WooCommerce da Easy Digital Downloads','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Easy Digital Downloads'=>'Easy Digital Downloads','Most recent orders to show'=>'Umarnin da suka fi kusa da na baya da za a nuna','Oldest order (days)'=>'Tsohuwar oda (kwanaki)','Name the product'=>'Sanya wa samfurin suna','Say how long ago'=>'Ka ce tun ya yaushe','Timing and place'=>'Lokaci da wuri','Each notice shows for (seconds)'=>'Kowane sanarwa tana nuna na (seconds)','Pause between notices (seconds)'=>'Dakata tsakanin sanarwa (sakanni)','Bottom, reading start'=>'Kasa, karatu ya fara','Bottom, reading end'=>'Kasa, ƙarshen karatu','Where the notices come from'=>'Inda sanarwar ta fito','Only real, paid orders are shown, and only when the buyer ticked the box at checkout that lets this site show their first name and town. Once this page is saved, the checkout offers that box. Until an order with it arrives, visitors see nothing.'=>'An nuna ainihi