y'=>'Afa','Profile'=>'Bayanin mai amfani','Whose profile'=>'Wane ne bayanin martaba','The post’s author'=>'Marubucin labarin','Show the profile picture'=>'Nuna hoton bayanin martaba','Show the biography'=>'Nuna tarihin rayuwa','Show links to posts and website'=>'Nuna hanyoyin haɗi zuwa wallafe-wallafe da gidan yanar gizo','Author profile'=>'Bayanin marubuci','Choose whose profile to show.'=>'Zabi wane bayanin martaba za a nuna.','WhatsApp number, with country code'=>'Lambar WhatsApp, tare da lambar ƙasa','For example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Misali +44 7700 900123.','Message to start with (optional)'=>'Sako don farawa (na zaɓi)','Show the text next to the icon'=>'Nuna rubutun kusa da gunkin','Bottom end (right in English)'=>'Ƙarshen ƙasa (dama a Turanci)','Bottom start (left in English)'=>'Kasan hagu (hagu a Turanci)','Add your WhatsApp number in the sidebar. Until then the button is not shown on the page.'=>'Ƙara lamba ta WhatsApp a gefen shafi. Har zuwa lokacin ba a nuna maɓallin a shafin ba.','On the page, this button floats in a bottom corner of the screen.'=>'A kan shafin, wannan maballin yana shawagi a kusurwar ƙasa ta allo.','Shortcode tag'=>'Lambar gajeren lokaci','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Yi amfani da haruffa, lamba, da alamomin gajeren layi da na karkashin layi kawai.','Attribute name'=>'Sunan sifa','Add attribute'=>'Ƙara siffa','Shortcode'=>'Gajeriyar lamba','Other attributes'=>'Sauran siffofi','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Zaɓi alamar gajeren lamba (shortcode) a cikin saitunan bazuwar.','Image size'=>'Girman hoto','Thumbnail'=>'Hoton ƙarami','Full size'=>'Cikakken girma','Link to'=>'Haɗa zuwa','Attachment page'=>'Shafin abin da aka makala','Media file'=>'Fayil na kafofin watsa labarai','Audio'=>'Sauti','Video'=>'Bidiyo','File address'=>'Adireshin fayil','Poster image'=>'Hoton bango','Media IDs, separated by commas'=>'An ID din kafofin watsa labarai, waɗanda aka raba su da alamun comma','Show the track list'=>'Nuna jerin waƙoƙi','Embed'=>'Shiga da shi','Address to embed'=>'Adireshin da za a saka','Maximum width'=>'Mafi girman fadi','Image and caption HTML'=>'Hoton HTML da taken sa','Tip: the Form block shows this form styled to match your site.'=>'Shawara: Sashin Form yana nuna wannan fom ɗin an yi masa ado ya yi daidai da shafin ku.','Show the form title'=>'Nuna sunan fom din','Show the form description'=>'Nuna bayanin fom din','Submit without reloading the page'=>'Mika ba tare da sake loda shafin ba','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Ba a samun ikon "%s" daga tsohon edita a cikin editan tubali ba. Shigar da ƙimar a matsayin rubutu.','Choose file'=>'Zaɓi fayil','— Default —'=>'— Na asali —','Advanced styling'=>'Tsara salo na gaba','Inline CSS'=>'Inline CSS','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Sanarwar CSS, alal misali: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Tasiri (tsofaffin aji)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Sunayen tasiri masu rarrabuwa da sarari da aka kawo daga tsofaffin sigogi, alal misali: hover-shadow','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Cikakken faɗi, an ajiye abubuwa a tsakiya','Link relationship'=>'Alakar mahada','Left'=>'Hagu','Right'=>'Dama','Add text…'=>'Ƙara rubutu…','Placement'=>'Matsayi','On its own line'=>'A kan nasa layin','In the line, beside other content'=>'A cikin layin, kusa da sauran abun ciki','Automatic (own line at the top level of the page)'=>'Atomatik (kan layi na kansa a babban matakin shafin)','Accessible label'=>'Alamar samuwa','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Bar a banza domin gunkin ado.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Zabi wani gunkin a cikin saitunan shingen.','New setting name'=>'Sabon sunan saitin','For example: title or text'=>'Misali: taken ko rubutu','Add setting'=>'Ƙara saitin','Widget'=>'Widget','Choose a widget'=>'Zaɓi widget','Widget area'=>'Yankin widget','Choose a widget area'=>'Zabi yankin widget','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Wannan hoton bazu da faɗi da tsayi ba, saboda haka shafin zai yi tsalle lokacin da ya loda. Zaɓi shi daga Laburare na Media, ko saita faɗinsa da tsayinsa.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Wannan bidiyon ba ya fitowa daga ɗakin karatu na Media, saboda haka girmansa ba a sani ba kuma shafin zai yi tsalle lokacin da ya โหลด. Maimakon haka, loda shi zuwa ɗakin karatu na Media.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Wani hoto ko bidiyo ko firam a cikin wannan HTML ba shi da faɗi da tsayi, don haka shafin zai yi tsalle lokacin da ya loda. Ƙara siffofin faɗi da tsayi a gare shi.','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Wannan shigarwar tana sake girman kanta bayan ta loda, wanda ke motsa abubuwan da ke ƙasanta. Ba shi wuri ko sanya shi a ƙasa a shafin.','Layout shift'=>'Sauye-sauyen tsari','This widget does not describe its settings, so they are edited as name and value pairs.'=>'Wannan widget ɗin baya bayyana saitunansa ba, don haka ana gyara su a matsayin nau\'ikan suna da ƙima.','Problem'=>'Matsala','Check'=>'Bincika','Show block'=>'Nuna shafi','Use a readable theme colour'=>'Yi amfani da launin jigo mai sauƙin karatu','Make it H%d'=>'Sanya shi ya zama H%d','Alt text'=>'Rubutun madadin','Save alt text'=>'Ajiye rubutun alt','This image is decorative'=>'Wannan hoton na ado ne','Checking…'=>'Ana dubawa...','No accessibility problems found on this page.'=>'Ba a sami matsalar samun dama a kan wannan shafi ba.','%1$s, %2$s.'=>'%1$s, %2$s.','%d problem'=>'matsala %d' . "\0" . 'Matsala %d','%d thing to check'=>'abun da za a duba %d' . "\0" . 'Abubuwa %d da za a duba','Check again'=>'Sake dubawa','An automatic check finds many problems but not all of them. Also try the page with the keyboard alone and with a screen reader.'=>'Wani bincike mai zuwa da kansa yana samun matsala da yawa amma ba duka ba. Har ila yau, gwada shafin tare da madannin kwamfuta kawai da kuma mai karatun allo.','Text contrast is %1$s:1; it needs at least %2$s:1 to be readable.'=>'Bambancin launi na rubutu shine %1$s:1; yana buƙatar aƙalla %2$s:1 don ya zama mai karantawa.','click here,here,read more,more,link,this link,learn more,go'=>'danna nan,anan,kara karantawa,ƙari,mahada,wannan mahadar,ƙara koyo,tafi','A link has no text, so a screen reader announces only “link”. Add text or a label.'=>'Haɗin ba shi da rubutu, don haka mai karanta allo zai faɗi kawai "haɗin". Ƙara rubutu ko alama.','The link text “%s” does not say where it goes. Describe the destination instead.'=>'Rubutun da ke kan hanyar sadarwa “%s” bai nuna inda zai kai ba. Maimakon haka, bayyana inda zai je.','An element has a positive tabindex, which changes the keyboard order away from the reading order. Use 0 or remove it.'=>'Wani abu yana da tabindex mai kyau, wanda ke canza tsarin madannai daga tsarin karatu. Yi amfani da 0 ko cire shi.','Something clickable cannot be reached with the keyboard. Use a real button or link.'=>'Ba a iya isa ga abin da ake danna wa ta amfani da madannin kwamfuta. Yi amfani da ainihin maballin ko mahaɗi.','An embedded frame has no title, so a screen reader cannot say what it is.'=>'Ba a ba wa wani ingantaccen tsarin da aka saka take ba, don haka mai karanta allo ba zai iya fadin abin da yake ba.','A form field has no label, so its purpose is not announced.'=>'Wani fili a cikin fom ba shi da lakabi, don haka ba a bayyana manufarsa ba.','This heading is empty. Screen reader users navigate by headings; remove it or add text.'=>'Wannan kan gaba ba komai a ciki. Masu amfani da mai karanta allo suna zirga-zirga ta hanyar kan gaba; cire shi ko ƙara rubutu.','The page title is already the H1; use H2 for the top level of the content.'=>'Sunan shafin riga shine H1; yi amfani da H2 don matakin sama na abubuwan da ke ciki.','This H%1$d skips a level; the one before it is H%2$d. Make it an H%3$d.'=>'Wannan H%1$d yana tsallake mataki ɗaya; wanda ke gabaninsa shine H%2$d. Sanya shi ya zama H%3$d.','This image has no alt text. Describe it, or mark it as decorative if it adds nothing.'=>'Wannan hoton bazuwa da rubutun alt ba. Bayyana shi, ko kuma ka sanya shi a matsayin mai ƙawata idan bai ƙara komai ba.','Close panel'=>'Rufe kwamitin','Desktop'=>'Desktop','Default'=>'Tsohuwa','Every track'=>'Kowane waƙa','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Girman waƙa, misali: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Girman waƙa na al\'ada','Equal tracks'=>'Sauye-sauye daidai','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'An ambato aka nuna a kowane layi, misali: "head head" "side main". Sanya suna a kan kowane yanki na yara.','Automatic'=>'Mai kansa','Square (1:1)'=>'Dandalin (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Daidai (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'Classic (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'Faɗi (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'Cinema (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'Tsayi (9:16)','Custom'=>'Na Musamman','Width / height'=>'Faɗin ƙasa / tsayi','Background image'=>'Hoton bango','Inherited image — replace'=>'Hoto da aka gada — maye gurbi','Cover'=>'Murfin hoto','Contain'=>'Ƙunsa','Original size'=>'Asalin girma','Repeat'=>'Maimaita','No repeat'=>'Babu maimaitawa','Tile'=>'Fayil','Tile across'=>'Sanya fannoni a fadin kasa','Tile down'=>'Rufe ƙasa','Fixed while scrolling'=>'An tsayar da shi yayin gungurawa','Solid'=>'Mai ƙarfi','Dashed'=>'Mai ɗigo-ɗigo','Dotted'=>'Mai digiri-digiri','Double'=>'Sau biyu','Each side separately'=>'Kowane gefe daban-daban','Side'=>'Gefe','Add a shadow'=>'Ƙara inuwa','Horizontal'=>'A kwance'