se a see-through colour)'=>'Waiwayi (yi amfani da launi mai haske)','Blob'=>'Blob','Hexagon'=>'Hexagon','Triangle'=>'Triangle','Diamond'=>'Diamond','Heart'=>'Zuciya','Arch'=>'Arch','Brush stroke'=>'Bugun goga','Mask shape'=>'Sifar maski','Custom image'=>'Hoton da aka keɓance','Replace mask image'=>'Maye gurbin hoton abin rufe fuska','Choose mask image'=>'Zaɓi hoton abin rufe fuska','Fit'=>'Daidaita','Repeat across'=>'Maimaita ko\'ina','Repeat down'=>'Maimaita kasa','Space out'=>'Fitar da sarari','Stretch to fit'=>'Mika don ya dace','Multiply'=>'Ninka','Screen'=>'Allon aiki','Overlay'=>'Shimfiɗa','Darken'=>'Sanya duhu','Lighten'=>'Saukaka','Colour dodge'=>'Firam ɗoji','Colour burn'=>'Kona mai konewa','Hard light'=>'Tsananin haske','Soft light'=>'Haske mai laushi','Difference'=>'Bambanci','Exclusion'=>'Babuwa','Hue'=>'Launi','Saturation'=>'Moraɗa','Luminosity'=>'Haske','Blend mode'=>'Hanyar gaurayawa','Blur (px)'=>'Burciwa (px)','Brightness (%)'=>'Haske (%)','Contrast (%)'=>'Saban (%)','Greyscale (%)'=>'Launin toka (%)','Hue rotation (degrees)'=>'Juuyawar launuka (digiri)','Saturation (%)'=>'Cikewa (%)','Sepia (%)'=>'Sepia (%)','Drop shadow'=>'Inuwa ta baya','Across (px)'=>'Akwai (px)','Down (px)'=>'Kasa (px)','Softness (px)'=>'Laushi (px)','Shadow colour'=>'Launin Inuwa','Remove drop shadow'=>'Cire inuwar faduwa','Applies on every screen size.'=>'Ana amfani da shi a kowane girman allo.','Applies to the screen size chosen in the design panel.'=>'Yana shafa girman allon da aka zaɓa a cikin bangaren zane.','Background gradient'=>'Launin bango mai ɗumi','Add gradient'=>'Ƙara gradient','Glass'=>'Gilashi','Mask'=>'Masko','Filters'=>'Matattara','Wave'=>'Wave','Waves'=>'Waves','Curve'=>'Kankara','Curve (asymmetric)'=>'Curve (asymmetric)','Arc'=>'Baka','Tilt'=>'Karkata','Tilt (layered)'=>'Karkata (ma da yawa)','Triangle (asymmetric)'=>'Uku-uku (wanda ba ya daidaita)','Split'=>'Raba','Zigzag'=>'Zigzag','Mountains'=>'Dutse','Clouds'=>'Gajimare','Drops'=>'Saukarwa','Pyramids'=>'Pyramids','Book'=>'Yi Ajiya','Stairs'=>'Matakala','Fan'=>'Magoya baya','Height (px)'=>'Tsayi (px)','Mirror'=>'Madubi','Invert'=>'Juya','In front of the content'=>'Gaban abubuwan dake ciki','Source'=>'Maɓalli','Video file (MP4 / WebM)'=>'Fayil din bidiyo (MP4 / WebM)','Choose MP4 or WebM video'=>'Zaɓi bidiyon MP4 ko WebM','MP4 address'=>'Adireshin MP4','WebM address'=>'Adireshin WebM','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'ID na bidiyon YouTube (haruffa 11)','Vimeo video number'=>'Lambar bidiyon Vimeo','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'Baƙi na tuntuɓar sabis na bidiyo ne kawai lokacin da suka gungura zuwa wannan sashin, kuma ba a taɓa yin hakan ba lokacin da na\'urarsu ta nemi raguwar motsi. Har zuwa lokacin suna ganin hoton faston.','Replace poster image'=>'Maye gurbin hoton mai tallatawa','Choose poster image'=>'Zaɓi hoton bango','Background slideshow'=>'Hoton bango na kallo mai jujjuyawa','Change images'=>'Canza hotuna','Choose at least two images.'=>'Zaɓi aƙalla hotuna biyu.','Seconds per image'=>'Sekon kowace hoto','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Jinkiri a hankali (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Cire hotunan nuni','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Masu ziyara da suka roƙi na\'urarsu da ta rage motsi suna ganin hoto na farko kawai.','Section effects'=>'Tasirin sashe','Top divider'=>'Babban mai raba abun ciki','Bottom divider'=>'Rabona ta kasa','Choose the logo'=>'Zabi tambarin','Not set'=>'Ba a saita ba','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Bincika launukan alamar: kowanne yana buƙatar suna na musamman da kuma ingantaccen launi.','Brand name'=>'Sunan alamar kasuwanci','A logo is chosen.'=>'An zaɓi tambari.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Zaɓi tambarin daga shafin Tsarin Yanar Gizo.','Brand colours'=>'Launin alama','Brand %d'=>'Alamar %d','Add brand colour'=>'Ƙara launin alama','Heading font'=>'Font din jigo','Body font'=>'Rubutun jiki','Tone of voice'=>'Salon murya','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Yadda alamarku ke rubutu, misali "Abokantaka da sauƙi, gajerun jimloli, ba tare da ƙwarewa mai rikitarwa ba." AI na bin shi a duk lokacin da yake rubuta wa wannan shafin.','Brand kit saved.'=>'An adana kayan aikin alama.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'An yi amfani da alamar kasuwanci: launukanta, rubutunta da tambarinta yanzu sun zama na shafin.','Apply to site'=>'Afa da shafi','All classes'=>'Duk azuzuwan','Class name on the page'=>'Sunan ajji a shafin','Printed as %s.'=>'An buga a matsayin %s.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Fara da harafi; kananan haruffa, lambobi da manyan layuka kawai.','Styles'=>'Salonki','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Ba a loda sarrafa salon ba. Sake loda shafin; idan hakan ta ci gaba, sake shigar da plugin ɗin.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'An ajiye ajin. Kowane bangare da ke amfani da shi yana da sabon salon.','Save class'=>'Ajiye aji','Class created.'=>'An halicci ajin.','New class'=>'Sabon aji','e.g. Card'=>'misali Katin','Create'=>'Ƙirƙira','Search classes'=>'Bincike ajujuwa','No class matches.'=>'Babu ajin da ya dace.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Babu azuzuwa tukuna. Ka ƙirƙiri ɗaya, ka tsara shi, sannan ka ƙara shi ga kowane abu daga saitunansa.','Edit %s'=>'Gyara %s','Class duplicated.'=>'An kwafi ajin.','Delete %s'=>'Goge %s','Class deleted.'=>'An cire ajujuwa.','Delete'=>'Goge','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Soke ajin "%s"? Abubuwan da ke amfani da shi za su riƙe abubuwansu su rasa salonsu.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Masu amfani kawai da za su iya ƙara HTML da ba a taƙaita ba ne za su iya Canza CSS na musamman.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Wasu daga cikin wannan CSS ɗin ba za a yi amfani da su ba: An cire @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, da "<" da kuma maƙallan da ba su da daidaito don dalilan tsaro.','Upload a font'=>'Loda wani font','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Loda fonte yana buƙatar WordPress 6.5 ko kuma wanda ya fi haka.','Font name'=>'Sunan harafi','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'misali Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'An loda %s kuma yana shirye don amfani.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Zaɓi fayil ɗin rubutu (%s)','Font library'=>'Laburaren haruffa','%d files'=>'fayiloli %d','Font switched off for the site.'=>'An kashe rubutun ga rukunin yanar gizon.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'An kunna rubutu don shafin.','Switch off'=>'Kashe','Switch on'=>'Kunna','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Saka lambar kit din aikin Adobe Fonts na yanar gizo. Sannan a loda font ɗinsa daga Adobe a shafukanka.','Your web projects'=>'Ayyukan gidan yanar gizonku','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'An haɗa Adobe Fonts.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'An cire Adobe Fonts.','Kit id'=>'ID ɗin kayan aiki','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'Kasar duhu na "%s" ba ta da inganci launin gaske.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Lokacin da ba a zaɓi baƙo','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Bi na\'urar mai ziyara','Dark colours'=>'Launin duhu','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Ba kowane launi sigarsa ta duhu ba. Launukan da aka bari babu komai za su kasance iri ɗaya a jeri biyu. Yanayin duhu yana aiki da zaran launi ɗaya ya sami ƙimar duhu.','Dark version of %s'=>'Sigar duhu ta %s','Dark mode saved.'=>'An adana yanayin duhu.','Page CSS'=>'Shafin CSS','Global classes'=>'Azuzu na duniya gaba ɗaya','Classes'=>'Azuzu','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Ƙirƙiri azuzuwa a cikin Tsarin shafin, sannan ka ƙara su anan.','Custom CSS'=>'CSS na Musamman','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Rubuta dokoki don wannan abin. "selector" yana nufin wannan abin, misali selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — bayyanannun sanarwa suna aiki ne akan abin da kansa.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Dole fayilolin rubutu su kasance %s.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin rubutun babu komai a ciki ko kuma ya fi MB 10.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Sanya salon sau ɗaya, sake amfani da shi ko\'ina, ka canza a wuri guda.','Variables'=>'Canje-canje','Named values any element can use.'=>'Ƙimar da aka sanya wa suna wadda kowane abu zai iya amfani da ita.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Ratse, da\'ira da inuwa','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Ma\'aunin da kowane zabin sarari, kusurwa da inuwa ke bayarwa.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Wani sigar launukanka mai duhu, ga baƙi masu son shi.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Alamar, launi, haruffa da sautin murci, waɗanda AI da samfura ke amfani da su.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'Sanya naka rubutun ko kuma ka haɗa da Adobe Fonts.','CSS for this page only.'=>'CSS don ga wannan shafin kawai.','CSS for this page'=>'CSS don wannan shafi','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'An loda shi a kan wannan shafi kawai, bayan salon rukunin yanar gizon. An adana shi tare da shafin.','Short name'=>'Takaitaccen suna','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'An gajeren sunan "%s" an yi amfani da shi sau biyu.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": gajerun sunaye suna amfani da kananan haruffa, lambobi da kuma Alamomin raba kalmomi.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'Darajar "%s" ba ta kasance ɗaya daga cikin waɗanda wannan saitin ke karɓa ba.','Radius'=>'Radius','Add a step'=>'Ƙara mataki daya','Scales saved.'=>'An adana sikelin.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'An koma da sikelin zuwa tsoffin tsarin.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Sake saiti zuwa ma\'auni na asali','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Babu ma\'auni tukuna. Ma\'auni yana riƙe da ƙima guda ɗaya — faɗi, cakuda launi, girmansa — wanda abubuwa da yawa ke rabawa.','Add variable'=>'Ƙara maɓalli','Variables saved.'=>'An adana sauye-sauye.','Place ID'=>'Wurin ID','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'Nemo shi ta amfani da mai binciken Place ID na Google: bincika kasuwancin ku sannan ku kwafi ID ɗin.','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'Maɓallin API daga aikin ku na Google Cloud tare da Places API (New) da aka kunna. Takaita shi zuwa wannan API din.','Business unit ID'=>'ID na sashin kasuwanci','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'ID ɗin haruffa 24 na kasuwancin ku akan Trustpilot, daga asusun ajiyar ku na Trustpilot Business (Integrations › API).','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Maɓallin API na asusunka na Trustpilot Business.','Not set up.'=>'Ba a saita ba.','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ba za a iya karanta maɓallin da aka adana ba (an sauya maɓallin tsaro na shafin). Shigar da shi sake.','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'Yana buƙatar ID da kuma maɓallin API.','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'Saita. Ana loda sharhi na Google kai tsaye a duk lokacin da aka kalli shafi mai dauke da tubalin Sharhi: buƙatar Bayanin Wuri ɗaya a kan maɓallan ku a kowace kallo, ba a taɓa adana su ba (sharuɗɗan Google ba sa ba da damar riƙe su ba).','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'Wurin sabuntawa na farko ya gaza: %s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'Ana jiran sabuntawa ta farko (cikin minti daya ko biyu).','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'An sabunta %1$s: An adana bita %2$d, an ba shi matsayi %3$s daga cikin %4$d.','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'Kokari na karshe, %1$s, ya gaza kuma an kiyaye bitar da ke sama: %2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'An adana. Ana karɓo sharhin Trustpilot a bango cikin minti ɗaya ko biyu; sharhin Google na lodi kai tsaye a shafin.','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Ana samo bituttukan Trustpilot sau ɗaya a rana a bango a kuma ajiye su a kan shafinka, don haka shafi mai aiki tuƙuru ba ya biyan ko sisi a asusunka na Trustpilot; idan sabuntawa ta gaza, bituttukan da suka gabata suna nan. Google ba ya ƙyale a adana bituttukansa, don haka ana ɗora su kai tsaye lokacin da baƙo ya kalli shafin: kowane gani buƙata ce ɗaya a kan maɓallin Google ɗinka, wanda Google ke caji.','Where to find it'=>'Inda za a samo shi','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'An adana (…%s). Rubuta sabo don maye gurbin sa.','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'Cire cikakkun bayanai na %s da bitar su','Refreshed.'=>'An sabunta.','Refresh now'=>'Sake sabunta yanzu','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'Sabuntawar yau da kullum ta gaba: %s.','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'Bayanan ku na Google da Trustpilot, don bangaren sharhi.','No colours yet.'=>'Babu launuka tukuna.','Colour %d'=>'Launi %d','Add colour'=>'Ƙara launi','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Launi biyu suna da sunan iri ɗaya. Sake wa ɗaya suna.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" ba launi ne mai inganci ba.','Theme colours'=>'Launukan jigo','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Falettar jigon ku. Canji a nan ana adana shi azaman sigar rini ta shafin ku, ta daidai yadda Editan Shafin ke adana shi, kuma yana aiki a ko\'ina inda aka yi amfani da rinin.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Launi na jigo sun koma ga kansa na jigo.','Reset theme colours'=>'Sake saitin launukan jigo','Your colours'=>'Launukanka','Colours saved.'=>'An adana launuka.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'Zaɓi launi don %s','Clear'=>'Sharege','The change could not be saved.'=>'Ba a iya adana sauyi ba.','Theme default'=>'An tsoffin jigo','Theme fonts'=>'Fontunan jigo','Your fonts'=>'Rubutunka na asali','Font stack'=>'Jerin haruffa','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Font da aka loda: fayilolinsa sun fito ne daga ɗakin karatu na font.','System sans-serif'=>'Tsarin sans-serif','Add font stack'=>'Ƙara tarin font','Fonts saved.'=>'An adana rubutun.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'An raba shi da jigon ku da Editan Shafin.','Fonts'=>'Fontuna','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Rubutun shugaba da na jiki ga dukan shafin yanar gizon.','Back to Site design'=>'Komawa zuwa Tsarin shafin','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Aji, alamomi, yanayin duhu, kayan aikin alama da rubutun hannu na musamman sun zo tare da Pro','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Buɗe salon Editan Shafin','A heading with a tighter line height, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Wani kan gaba mai takaitaccen tsayin layi, wanda aka tsara da shafin Salo.','A paragraph of text, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Wani sakin layi na rubutu, wanda aka tsara tare da shafin Salo.','An image with rounded corners, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Wani hoto mai karkatattun kusurwoyi, wanda aka tsara tare da shafin Salo.','A video from the Media Library, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Wani bidiyo daga Laburaren Kafofin Watsa Labarai, wanda aka tsara da shafin Salo.','Spacer'=>'Wuri','Empty space between blocks; set a different height per screen size in the Style tab.'=>'Bakin sarari tsakanin tubalan; saita tsayin da ya bambanta a kowane girman allo a shafin Salo.','Divider'=>'Masu rarrabewa','A horizontal line between sections, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Wani layi a kwance tsakanin sassa, wanda aka tsara da shafin Style.','Content from another site (a video, a post, a map) by pasting its address.'=>'Abubuwa daga wani shafi (bidiyo, sakon, taswira) ta hanyar liƙa adireshinsa.','Several images in a grid, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Hotuna da yawa a cikin wani gajeren layi, an tsara su da shafin Style.','Plain'=>'Na yau da kullum','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Babu harsunan da za a iya canzawa tsakaninsu. Maɓallin canza harshe yana bayyana ne lokacin da wani kari na fassara ya lissafa harsuna biyu ko fiye.','Switcher'=>'Mai canzawa','Show the current language'=>'Nuna harshen da ake ciki yanzu','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Shigar da Tranzly kuma ka sanya jerin harsuna biyu ko fiye, kuma za a nuna mai canza harshen anan.','Pills'=>'Kwayoyi','Dropdown'=>'Menu mai sauka','Language codes'=>'Lambar Harsuna','Show each language as'=>'Nuna kowane harshe a matsayin','Language name'=>'Sunan harshe','Language code'=>'Lamba harshe','Name and code'=>'Suna da lamba','Flags'=>'Alamar saƙo','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'A kashe yake a asali: tuta kasa ce, ba harshe ba.','Include the current language'=>'Haɗa da harshen yanzu','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Boye da harsunan da ba a fassara wannan shafin zuwa gare su ba','Stack vertically'=>'Ajiye a tsaye','Current language text'=>'Harshen da ake ciki a yanzu','Current language background'=>'Bayanin yaren da ake ciki a yanzu','Size and spacing'=>'Girma da tazara','Space between languages'=>'Sarari tsakanin harsuna','Text size'=>'Girman rubutu','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s yana gyara wannan shafin kuma. Ajiye zai iya rubuta a kan gyare-gyarensa.','Block library'=>'Laburaren buloka','Layers'=>'Taruka','Page canvas'=>'Filin shafi','Revisions'=>'Gyare-gyare','Block settings'=>'Saitunan katange','Add block: %s'=>'Ƙara tubali: %s','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Buɗe a Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Sake dawo da shi','Redo'=>'Sake yi','Show or hide layers'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye yadudduka','Show or hide the block library'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye ɗakin karatu na bulolin','Show revisions'=>'Nuna gyare-gyare','Open the normal editor'=>'Buɗe edita na al\'ada','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Gajerun hanyoyin madannai','Preview: desktop'=>'Dubawa: kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka','Preview: tablet'=>'Dubawa: kwamfutar hannu','Preview: mobile'=>'Gani a wayar hannu:','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Kwafi salin zababben tubalin','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Liya sanyin salon a kan zababben tubalin','Copy the selected section'=>'Kwafi sashin da aka zaɓa','Paste a copied section'=>'Liƙa sashen da aka kwafi','Turn off safe mode'=>'Kashe yanayin aminci','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Kunna yanayin aminci (sauran ɗorawa a kashe, a gare ka, a Studio kaɗai)','Scheduled'=>'An tsara','Pending review'=>'Ana jiran dubawa','Private'=>'Maigirma','Draft'=>'Da-aka-tsara','All changes saved'=>'An adana duk sauye-sauye','Saving…'=>'Ana adanawa...','Autosaving…'=>'Ana adanawa ta atomatik…','Unsaved changes'=>'Canjin da ba a ajiyewa ba','autosaved'=>'an adana ta atomatik','Desktop preview'=>'Samfurin kwamfuta ta tebur','Tablet preview'=>'Dubawar kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka','Mobile preview'=>'Duban wayar hannu','%1$s preview (%2$d px)'=>'Misalin %1$s (%2$d px)','Studio toolbar'=>'Sandar kayan aiki ta Studio','Back to the normal editor'=>'Koma zuwa edita na al\'ada','Page title'=>'Sunan shafi','Preview width'=>'Fadin samfoti','Command palette'=>'Kundin umarni','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Duba shafi (yana buɗe a cikin sabon shafi)','Save draft'=>'Ajiye daftari','Publish'=>'Bugawa','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Sake dawo da canjin da ba a ajiyee ba?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Wannan shafin yana da canje-canjen da ba a taba adana su ba. An kiyaye su a cikin wannan burauz din:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Wannan shafin yana da sabon kwafin da aka adana ta atomatik fiye da sigar da aka adana:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Mayar da canje-canjen da ba a ajiyewa ba','Discard'=>'Kora da shi','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Ba a iya loda gyare-gyaren ba.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'An dawo da fasalin da aka gyara. Ajiye don riƙe shi, ko a soke don komawa baya.','Close revisions'=>'Rufe bita','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Ba a yi gyare-gyare ba tukuna. Kowace adanawa tana ƙirƙirar ɗaya.','Revision from %s'=>'Revision daga %s','Restore this revision'=>'Maido da wannan bita','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'Ba aweza canza yanayin aminci ba.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Yanayin tsaro yana kunne.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'An kashe wani plug-in %d daban, domin ku kadai kuma a cikin Sandwich Studio kadai. Wannan ba zai shafi raddadin rukunin yanar gizo na gaske da sauran masu amfani ba.' . "\0" . 'Wasu plugins %d an kashe su, domin ku da kuma a Sandwich Studio kadai. Ba a shafar shafin da ke aiki da sauran masu amfani ba.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Yanayin lafiya: kashe sauranfulojoji a cikin Studio, don ku kadai','Save your changes.'=>'Ajiye canje-canjenku.','Undo your last change.'=>'Sake dawo da sauye-kayenku na ƙarshe.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Maimaita abin da ka soke na karshe.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Nuna ko ɓoye kwamitin yadudduka.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Nuna waɗannan gajerun hanyoyin madannai.','Select a block first.'=>'Zaɓi buloka tukuna.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'An kwafi salon. Manna shi a kan kowane buloku, a kan wannan shafin ko wani.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Mai binciken ya ki kwafi.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'An kwafi sashen. Manna shi a kowane shafi, a wannan shafin ko wani.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Ba a adana salon da aka kwafi daga Sandwich Studio a cikin allo ba.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Salon da aka manna a kan tubali %d.' . "\0" . 'An shafa salo a kan tubalan %d.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Wannan salon bai dace da katangar da aka zaɓa ba.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Allon kwafi ba shi da wani yanki da aka kwafa.','Section pasted.'=>'An manna da aka liƙa.','Paste style'=>'Manna salon salo','Paste section'=>'Manna sashe','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Latsa Ctrl+V (ko Cmd+V a kan Mac) anan don mannawa','Copy style'=>'Kofe salo','Copy section'=>'Kwafi sashin','Edit in Sandwi